1
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:07,140
[♪ upbeat music playing]

2
00:00:13,514 --> 00:00:15,516
[bell dings]

3
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:19,953
[announcer] The winner of I Am Boxer will
receive a grand prize of 300 million won

4
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,190
and a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.

5
00:00:26,527 --> 00:00:29,563
Round 3 of I Am Boxer.

6
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:31,298
The Three Rings.

7
00:00:31,365 --> 00:00:33,600
[contestant 1] They're dropping
a chicken coop on us.

8
00:00:35,102 --> 00:00:36,470
[announcer] The cage ring.

9
00:00:37,304 --> 00:00:39,306
-The ring's basically a straight line.
-Two-on-two?

10
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,642
[announcer] The tag ring.

11
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:44,912
-Is that water?
-It's gonna rain too?

12
00:00:47,381 --> 00:00:48,682
[announcer] The aqua ring.

13
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,218
Anyone who loses the fight

14
00:00:51,752 --> 00:00:54,221
is immediately

15
00:00:54,621 --> 00:00:55,956
eliminated.

16
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:57,824
I Am Boxer,

17
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:00,794
the Three Rings.

18
00:01:02,596 --> 00:01:03,931
Up next for this bout…

19
00:01:05,866 --> 00:01:07,501
the cage ring.

20
00:01:12,306 --> 00:01:15,809
The fight in the cage ring
will be one-on-one

21
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:20,080
and have two 3-minute rounds.

22
00:01:21,748 --> 00:01:23,317
[contestant 1] Man, that chicken coop…

23
00:01:23,383 --> 00:01:24,484
It's way too narrow.

24
00:01:25,118 --> 00:01:26,720
-Looks like an underground arena.
-Yeah.

25
00:01:29,122 --> 00:01:32,259
Honestly, this setup
is pretty brutal for out-boxers.

26
00:01:32,326 --> 00:01:34,828
Yeah, it's way too small.
It's three meters all around.

27
00:01:36,029 --> 00:01:37,297
[announcer] The cage ring.

28
00:01:38,632 --> 00:01:40,767
Fighters, step in.

29
00:01:42,936 --> 00:01:45,806
Red corner, Kim Taesun.

30
00:01:45,872 --> 00:01:46,873
[contestant 1 grunts]

31
00:01:48,442 --> 00:01:49,476
You got this, man.

32
00:01:51,845 --> 00:01:56,817
[Jongkook] Anyone who wants to challenge
Kim Taesun, please step forward.

33
00:01:56,883 --> 00:01:58,151
[Dex] Seriously, who would want to?

34
00:01:58,986 --> 00:02:01,955
[Jongkook] And Kim Taesun's
a champion, you know.

35
00:02:02,656 --> 00:02:04,424
No way. Nobody's taking that.

36
00:02:06,827 --> 00:02:08,829
[contestants gasping]

37
00:02:10,163 --> 00:02:11,231
[contestant 1] So badass.

38
00:02:11,298 --> 00:02:12,366
[contestant 2] Awesome, coach!

39
00:02:12,432 --> 00:02:13,867
-[Lee] Nice.
-[Jongkook] He's the man.

40
00:02:13,934 --> 00:02:15,202
A man's man.

41
00:02:15,268 --> 00:02:16,536
[contestant 4 exclaims]

42
00:02:19,406 --> 00:02:22,542
I never made it all the way

43
00:02:22,609 --> 00:02:25,379
to a championship as a pro,

44
00:02:26,246 --> 00:02:30,450
so I thought I'd step up
to take on a real champion for once.

45
00:02:31,451 --> 00:02:35,856
[Jongkook] In the cage ring,
it's Kim Taesun versus Lee Sanggeun.

46
00:02:35,922 --> 00:02:37,391
KIM TAESUN VS LEE SANGGEUN

47
00:02:37,457 --> 00:02:38,925
[contestant 1] So it's those two, huh?

48
00:02:39,993 --> 00:02:41,728
It looks even smaller with them in there.

49
00:02:42,229 --> 00:02:43,730
There's no way he'd lose this.

50
00:02:47,834 --> 00:02:51,338
First off, I'm just glad to go up
against such an admirable opponent.

51
00:02:52,139 --> 00:02:54,908
I'll show you what a champion can do.

52
00:02:54,975 --> 00:02:57,577
-Love that confidence.
-[Jongkook] Absolutely.

53
00:02:57,644 --> 00:02:58,945
[Dex] He is a champion, after all.

54
00:03:00,247 --> 00:03:02,249
[contestant 1] Taesun's got this.
He's not losing this one.

55
00:03:02,749 --> 00:03:04,718
[sighs] It's so tiny, though.

56
00:03:04,785 --> 00:03:08,088
[contestant 2] Sure, we can manage.
But that's way too tight for you guys.

57
00:03:08,155 --> 00:03:09,690
It's crazy tight in there.

58
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,992
That thing's cramped.

59
00:03:12,059 --> 00:03:13,994
They just have to bang it out in there.

60
00:03:14,061 --> 00:03:15,896
-A straight-up fistfight.
-[Lee] Just bang it out.

61
00:03:18,498 --> 00:03:19,700
Once I actually stepped in,

62
00:03:19,766 --> 00:03:23,437
there was just enough room for me to move.

63
00:03:23,503 --> 00:03:25,939
So I thought,
"How do I game-plan in here?"

64
00:03:27,941 --> 00:03:32,579
Until now, I have only ever fought
in square rings over five meters in size.

65
00:03:32,646 --> 00:03:35,615
So the idea of fighting
in a cage like that

66
00:03:36,083 --> 00:03:37,284
felt pretty exciting.

67
00:03:38,552 --> 00:03:39,720
[referee] Fighters, in position.

68
00:03:40,787 --> 00:03:43,256
[announcer] Kim Taesun
versus Lee Sanggeun.

69
00:03:43,323 --> 00:03:45,692
-Let us begin the fight.
-Glove touch.

70
00:03:46,493 --> 00:03:47,494
Stand back.

71
00:03:48,161 --> 00:03:49,529
Two steps are just about it.

72
00:03:49,596 --> 00:03:51,064
There's no room to even back up.

73
00:03:53,033 --> 00:03:54,334
[contestant 2] This is nuts. [sighs]

74
00:03:56,636 --> 00:03:57,771
-Box!
-[bell dings]

75
00:03:57,838 --> 00:03:59,039
-Box!
-[contestants] Let's go!

76
00:03:59,106 --> 00:04:00,307
All right!

77
00:04:00,373 --> 00:04:03,543
KIM TAESUN X LEE SANGGEUN

78
00:04:03,610 --> 00:04:05,579
[Jongkook] He's going hard at him.

79
00:04:05,645 --> 00:04:06,713
Right from the start?

80
00:04:08,115 --> 00:04:09,616
He's going for a first-round finish.

81
00:04:09,683 --> 00:04:10,684
He's rushing.

82
00:04:14,287 --> 00:04:15,288
[contestants gasping]

83
00:04:15,355 --> 00:04:16,590
-There.
-Now we're talking.

84
00:04:17,157 --> 00:04:18,158
[Dex] There's that jab.

85
00:04:19,793 --> 00:04:22,062
[contestant 4 gasps] Wow,
that jab is so good.

86
00:04:23,897 --> 00:04:25,031
[contestant 5] Love that jab.

87
00:04:25,565 --> 00:04:28,001
-[contestant 6] Nice.
-He keeps getting tagged by the jab.

88
00:04:29,102 --> 00:04:31,972
[Taesun] My plan was to feel him out
in the first round.

89
00:04:32,038 --> 00:04:34,274
[contestant] Wow, his lead hand is sharp.

90
00:04:34,908 --> 00:04:36,476
[Sanggeun] That jab's really landing.

91
00:04:40,113 --> 00:04:43,016
[Dex] His jabs are knocking
Kim Taesun's whole body back.

92
00:04:43,650 --> 00:04:44,885
Man, I want that jab.

93
00:04:46,153 --> 00:04:49,389
[Taesun] He's in a higher weight class,
so I found myself getting pushed back.

94
00:04:49,990 --> 00:04:54,060
But my strength isn't just
my punching power.

95
00:04:54,127 --> 00:04:55,495
I've got a good chin too.

96
00:04:56,563 --> 00:05:01,001
I wanted to read his style
and drain his gas tank a bit,

97
00:05:01,067 --> 00:05:03,837
so I figured I'd eat a few shots.

98
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,109
The damage is probably adding up.

99
00:05:10,944 --> 00:05:12,245
His lead hand is great.

100
00:05:12,946 --> 00:05:14,514
[contestant 2] Don't go in.
Strike from there.

101
00:05:14,581 --> 00:05:16,116
Stay there and strike.

102
00:05:16,817 --> 00:05:17,818
Since it's so tight.

103
00:05:18,318 --> 00:05:20,654
-No room to dodge.
-Find your rhythm, Taesun.

104
00:05:22,155 --> 00:05:24,958
[Taesun] But once I started taking
the hits, they just kept landing.

105
00:05:25,592 --> 00:05:27,260
I thought, "This isn't going right."

106
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:32,566
[contestant 1] Man,
the lead hand really matters, huh?

107
00:05:33,667 --> 00:05:35,502
Wow, that jab is clean.

108
00:05:40,707 --> 00:05:42,576
[contestant 2] He needs
to catch him when he jabs.

109
00:05:43,376 --> 00:05:45,512
[contestants gasping]

110
00:05:48,481 --> 00:05:49,583
Okay, strike from there.

111
00:05:51,084 --> 00:05:52,285
[contestant 2] Get out of there.

112
00:05:52,986 --> 00:05:55,021
Once you're trapped, that's it.

113
00:05:55,088 --> 00:05:56,289
He needs to press forward.

114
00:05:57,657 --> 00:05:58,725
All right!

115
00:05:58,792 --> 00:05:59,926
Strike up close!

116
00:06:00,794 --> 00:06:02,062
-That's it.
-Ten seconds!

117
00:06:02,128 --> 00:06:03,330
-Ten seconds!
-Ten seconds!

118
00:06:04,497 --> 00:06:07,500
[contestant 2] The way he slips those
so easily shows how experienced he is.

119
00:06:08,568 --> 00:06:09,603
[contestant] All right!

120
00:06:10,904 --> 00:06:12,906
-[bell dings]
-[contestants exclaiming]

121
00:06:12,973 --> 00:06:14,140
[contestant] Dang, he's good.

122
00:06:15,175 --> 00:06:17,377
-Nicely done.
-That was great.

123
00:06:17,444 --> 00:06:18,778
[contestant] Nice game.

124
00:06:19,379 --> 00:06:20,480
That was something else.

125
00:06:21,581 --> 00:06:24,217
But in the second round,
I'm curious to see how…

126
00:06:24,284 --> 00:06:25,285
[Jongkook] We'll have to see.

127
00:06:25,352 --> 00:06:27,420
[Dex] I wonder how they'll manage
their gas tanks.

128
00:06:27,487 --> 00:06:29,556
[Jongkook] Lee Sanggeun's jab is
worth noting.

129
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,191
It's really sharp.

130
00:06:31,691 --> 00:06:33,393
[Sanggeun] My plan was working.

131
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,763
Taesun was struggling to find his way in.

132
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:39,366
I stuck to jabs,
countering when punches came in,

133
00:06:40,267 --> 00:06:42,702
and firing combos
whenever I saw an opening.

134
00:06:42,769 --> 00:06:44,437
That was my plan all along.

135
00:06:45,939 --> 00:06:48,742
My plan was to turn it up
in the second round anyway.

136
00:06:48,808 --> 00:06:52,345
I kept it tight to tire him out,

137
00:06:52,412 --> 00:06:55,815
and then switch the fight to my rhythm.

138
00:06:56,483 --> 00:06:59,519
Coach is great at flicking those shots in.

139
00:06:59,586 --> 00:07:00,954
He just pops them in.

140
00:07:01,421 --> 00:07:04,291
But Taesun's swinging too wide.
He seems a little thrown off.

141
00:07:04,357 --> 00:07:05,759
[Dongjin] His lead hand isn't landing.

142
00:07:06,493 --> 00:07:08,395
Let's see if Kim Taesun commits here.

143
00:07:09,696 --> 00:07:10,897
Let's go, guys!

144
00:07:10,964 --> 00:07:12,299
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

145
00:07:12,365 --> 00:07:13,366
[Lee] Oh, boy.

146
00:07:14,234 --> 00:07:15,936
-[contestant 1] It's the last round.
-[bell dings]

147
00:07:16,002 --> 00:07:17,237
[Lee] All right, the last round.

148
00:07:17,304 --> 00:07:18,438
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

149
00:07:18,505 --> 00:07:21,975
KIM TAESUN X LEE SANGGEUN

150
00:07:23,243 --> 00:07:24,477
-[gasps]
-Whoa, nice shot.

151
00:07:29,516 --> 00:07:31,251
-[all exclaim]
-Nice shot to the head!

152
00:07:31,318 --> 00:07:32,919
His jab's insane.

153
00:07:35,322 --> 00:07:37,590
[contestants exclaiming]

154
00:07:40,794 --> 00:07:41,962
Coach is doing awesome.

155
00:07:43,330 --> 00:07:46,166
[Taesun] Once I lost my timing,
I just kept losing it.

156
00:07:46,232 --> 00:07:48,601
That's when I knew I had to reset.

157
00:07:49,703 --> 00:07:53,073
So I decided to aim for the body
as best as I could.

158
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,642
Yeah, give one and take one!

159
00:07:55,709 --> 00:07:56,910
Sounds weighty.

160
00:07:58,712 --> 00:08:00,046
[contestant 1] Nice shot!

161
00:08:01,715 --> 00:08:03,083
Good. Now aim for the body!

162
00:08:08,822 --> 00:08:10,623
[Lee] Lee Sanggeun sticks it right in…

163
00:08:10,690 --> 00:08:12,592
-[contestants gasping]
-[gasps]

164
00:08:14,794 --> 00:08:17,530
His biggest flaw is
that he doesn't have a proper jab.

165
00:08:20,467 --> 00:08:21,468
His defense is solid.

166
00:08:22,068 --> 00:08:23,336
[contestant 3] Yes, use your range!

167
00:08:23,403 --> 00:08:24,938
-Nice shot!
-He's got him trapped.

168
00:08:28,074 --> 00:08:30,243
-He's trapped.
-He needs to stay out of the corner.

169
00:08:31,177 --> 00:08:32,812
-This is crazy.
-Get out of there!

170
00:08:35,281 --> 00:08:37,317
Don't give him that. Push forward.

171
00:08:37,817 --> 00:08:38,985
[contestant 2] You gotta move!

172
00:08:39,719 --> 00:08:40,920
[contestant 3] Get out of there!

173
00:08:40,987 --> 00:08:45,492
[Taesun] I'm not an infighter
who thrives in close-range combat.

174
00:08:45,558 --> 00:08:49,062
I'm a mid-range power puncher.

175
00:08:49,129 --> 00:08:51,464
That tiny cage isn't really for my style.

176
00:08:51,531 --> 00:08:53,333
So yeah, I struggled a little.

177
00:08:54,734 --> 00:08:55,869
You have to get out of it.

178
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:58,738
Keep moving, Taesun!

179
00:08:58,805 --> 00:08:59,906
[contestant 2] Nice one!

180
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:03,343
[Dex] For some reason,
Kim Taesun just can't get anything going.

181
00:09:03,410 --> 00:09:05,545
It's the jabs, they're adding damage.

182
00:09:05,612 --> 00:09:06,613
-Damage?
-It's bound to.

183
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:09,015
[Dex] Must be really adding up then.

184
00:09:09,082 --> 00:09:10,116
Strike from there! Jab!

185
00:09:10,183 --> 00:09:11,184
[contestant 1] That's it!

186
00:09:12,052 --> 00:09:13,053
That landed clean.

187
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,922
[contestants gasping]

188
00:09:17,757 --> 00:09:19,826
[exclaiming]

189
00:09:24,431 --> 00:09:26,566
This is insane. He took a lot of hits.

190
00:09:26,633 --> 00:09:28,468
[gasps]

191
00:09:32,038 --> 00:09:34,140
[contestant 1] Yes! Get him!

192
00:09:35,208 --> 00:09:36,543
[contestants exclaim]

193
00:09:36,609 --> 00:09:38,745
-Wow!
-[contestant 2] He's insane.

194
00:09:41,214 --> 00:09:43,450
-Ten seconds! Let's go!
-Last ten seconds!

195
00:09:43,516 --> 00:09:44,717
[contestant 5] Last one! Let's go!

196
00:09:47,153 --> 00:09:49,589
[contestants exclaiming]

197
00:09:52,258 --> 00:09:53,927
[contestant 7] Coach is incredible.

198
00:09:53,993 --> 00:09:56,629
KIM TAESUN X LEE SANGGEUN

199
00:09:56,696 --> 00:09:59,032
-Stop!
-[announcer] The fight is over.

200
00:10:00,233 --> 00:10:02,402
Now that's how you box. [chuckles]

201
00:10:02,469 --> 00:10:04,337
[exclaims]

202
00:10:04,404 --> 00:10:05,405
Great fight.

203
00:10:05,472 --> 00:10:06,773
[Jongkook] Seriously great.

204
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:09,075
[Lee] Both of you put
on a great fight, really.

205
00:10:09,142 --> 00:10:11,945
-You both did so well.
-[Jongkook] Honestly, this was… Wow.

206
00:10:12,011 --> 00:10:13,113
[contestant] That was no joke.

207
00:10:14,247 --> 00:10:16,015
The winner of this match is…

208
00:10:17,150 --> 00:10:18,985
OFFICIATED AND JUDGED
BY 20 PROFESSIONAL JUDGES

209
00:10:19,052 --> 00:10:21,054
FROM THE KOREAN BOXING
ASSOCIATION, KBF, AND KBM

210
00:10:24,157 --> 00:10:26,159
Lee Sanggeun from the blue corner.

211
00:10:26,226 --> 00:10:27,460
-[contestants gasping]
-[applause]

212
00:10:28,027 --> 00:10:29,295
BLUE CORNER
LEE SANGGEUN SURVIVES

213
00:10:29,362 --> 00:10:30,797
-Well played.
-Thank you.

214
00:10:30,864 --> 00:10:32,065
[contestant] Respect.

215
00:10:32,132 --> 00:10:34,100
That's what being a boxer is all about.

216
00:10:34,167 --> 00:10:35,969
You take hits, but you keep going.

217
00:10:36,035 --> 00:10:37,537
That's boxing right there.

218
00:10:39,339 --> 00:10:41,441
[Sanggeun] It was
an honor to fight a real champion.

219
00:10:41,508 --> 00:10:43,910
And winning just made me happier.

220
00:10:43,977 --> 00:10:44,978
[chuckles]

221
00:10:45,712 --> 00:10:48,748
[Taesun] I made it through
two consolation matches to get here,

222
00:10:48,815 --> 00:10:50,250
but I fought with no regrets.

223
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:51,951
I had fun.

224
00:10:53,052 --> 00:10:55,488
[announcer] This is
I Am Boxer's cage ring.

225
00:10:56,389 --> 00:11:00,059
[Lee] A regular office worker versus
a Muay Thai national team member.

226
00:11:00,126 --> 00:11:02,529
I'll show you that there can be an upset.

227
00:11:03,263 --> 00:11:04,364
[contestants] All right!

228
00:11:04,430 --> 00:11:05,932
I'll dominate this fight and win.

229
00:11:05,999 --> 00:11:07,000
Great.

230
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,568
-Box!
-[bell dings]

231
00:11:10,336 --> 00:11:11,471
That punch sounds insane…

232
00:11:11,871 --> 00:11:12,972
[gasps]

233
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,341
[contestant] He hits with good impact.

234
00:11:15,408 --> 00:11:17,110
-[Dex] Man, he's so…
-Powerful, isn't he?

235
00:11:17,177 --> 00:11:18,178
-He hits hard.
-Yeah.

236
00:11:18,678 --> 00:11:20,947
That's a Muay Thai punch right there.

237
00:11:21,014 --> 00:11:23,483
[Dex] You can really feel the force
behind Kim Hyunjun's punches.

238
00:11:24,918 --> 00:11:26,619
His boxing's solid for a Muay Thai guy.

239
00:11:26,686 --> 00:11:30,156
[Lee] The winner
of this match is Kim Hyunjun.

240
00:11:31,191 --> 00:11:34,027
[Dex] Next up,
a fight between the college boxers.

241
00:11:34,093 --> 00:11:35,094
LIM YUNCHAN VS NAM MINWOO

242
00:11:35,161 --> 00:11:36,529
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

243
00:11:36,596 --> 00:11:37,597
-Box!
-[bell dings]

244
00:11:38,464 --> 00:11:39,832
[exclaims]

245
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,035
-So that's his style of boxing.
-[grunts]

246
00:11:42,635 --> 00:11:43,870
[Dex] Nice.

247
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:45,471
But it's risky.

248
00:11:45,538 --> 00:11:47,507
You need to slip then throw,

249
00:11:47,574 --> 00:11:50,577
but if you only slip,
you're eventually going to eat one.

250
00:11:52,478 --> 00:11:54,247
That straight is so clean.

251
00:11:54,814 --> 00:11:56,716
-[contestants grunting]
-[contestants exclaim]

252
00:11:56,783 --> 00:11:57,784
He got caught clean!

253
00:11:57,850 --> 00:12:00,086
-[Jongkook] Lim Yunchan's pretty good too.
-[Lee] He's good.

254
00:12:01,354 --> 00:12:05,024
Lim Yunchan's style is pure fundamentals.

255
00:12:06,793 --> 00:12:08,728
The winner of this match is

256
00:12:09,262 --> 00:12:10,597
Lim Yunchan.

257
00:12:10,663 --> 00:12:11,764
RED CORNER LIM YUNCHAN SURVIVES

258
00:12:11,831 --> 00:12:13,066
They've matched these two?

259
00:12:13,132 --> 00:12:14,200
MOON JIHYEOK, AMATEUR BOXER
VS KWON OHGON,

260
00:12:14,267 --> 00:12:15,268
FORMER TWO-DIVISION CHAMP

261
00:12:15,735 --> 00:12:17,503
[Jihyeok] You can't beat youth.

262
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:19,505
[Ohgon] I'll make sure
to knock him out dead.

263
00:12:20,506 --> 00:12:21,975
[bell dings]

264
00:12:22,041 --> 00:12:23,042
Box!

265
00:12:25,044 --> 00:12:26,412
[contestants exclaim]

266
00:12:26,479 --> 00:12:27,480
He's super fast.

267
00:12:28,381 --> 00:12:29,449
[Lee] He's got speed.

268
00:12:29,515 --> 00:12:31,517
-[Dex] So that's "lightning fast."
-[Lee] Yeah.

269
00:12:32,952 --> 00:12:34,520
-[exclaim]
-All right!

270
00:12:36,456 --> 00:12:37,557
He's got great instincts.

271
00:12:38,992 --> 00:12:40,426
[Lee] He's absolutely savage.

272
00:12:42,829 --> 00:12:46,599
The winner of this match
is Kwon Ohgon from the blue corner.

273
00:12:47,734 --> 00:12:49,669
CAGE RING SURVIVORS - HYUNJUN,
YUNCHAN, OHGON, SANGGEUN

274
00:12:49,736 --> 00:12:53,172
EPISODE 5

275
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,108
[contestant] This game is fun to watch.

276
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:57,143
[announcer] The tag ring.

277
00:12:57,210 --> 00:12:58,845
Fighters, step in.

278
00:12:59,379 --> 00:13:00,380
Blue corner,

279
00:13:01,047 --> 00:13:03,416
Lee Gijun and Kim Minwoo.

280
00:13:04,317 --> 00:13:05,918
[contestant 1 exclaims]

281
00:13:05,985 --> 00:13:08,187
-[contestant 2] Go get 'em!
-[contestants] Let's do this!

282
00:13:08,254 --> 00:13:09,756
[contestant 3] Gijun's real good, though.

283
00:13:09,822 --> 00:13:12,091
-He's different.
-He's freaking good.

284
00:13:12,158 --> 00:13:15,828
[Lee] Lee Gijun is a member
of Woosuk University's boxing club.

285
00:13:15,895 --> 00:13:17,330
Whoa, look at that hot body!

286
00:13:17,864 --> 00:13:19,766
[contestant 6] His muscles are on fire.

287
00:13:21,634 --> 00:13:22,769
[contestants exclaim]

288
00:13:22,835 --> 00:13:24,337
[Lee] Oh, he's fast.

289
00:13:24,904 --> 00:13:26,839
-He's got great rhythm.
-[contestant] He's great.

290
00:13:27,407 --> 00:13:29,609
[contestant 1] Great movement.
He's got that Ghanaian rhythm.

291
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:33,046
[Dex] The way he dips and strikes…

292
00:13:33,112 --> 00:13:34,714
[Jongkook] He's so explosive.

293
00:13:34,781 --> 00:13:37,417
[contestant 2] It felt like I was watching
an international boxing match.

294
00:13:37,483 --> 00:13:42,355
[Gijun] I'll fight hard to the end
with no regrets.

295
00:13:43,222 --> 00:13:44,824
-His body's unreal.
-Gijun's real good.

296
00:13:46,092 --> 00:13:48,227
[Lee] Kim Minwoo is an MMA guy,

297
00:13:48,294 --> 00:13:50,897
but we picked him
because he boxed so well.

298
00:13:50,963 --> 00:13:51,964
-In the first round.
-Yes.

299
00:13:52,031 --> 00:13:54,567
Both of them are great. I love this.

300
00:13:56,102 --> 00:13:57,370
[announcer] Red corner,

301
00:13:57,437 --> 00:13:59,906
Kim Hunsu and Lee Juyeong.

302
00:13:59,972 --> 00:14:00,973
Let's go, Juyeong!

303
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:03,643
-[contestant 1] You got this, Juyeong!
-[contestant 2] Go get 'em!

304
00:14:04,477 --> 00:14:06,112
What does this other team do?

305
00:14:06,179 --> 00:14:09,215
The guy on the right plays volleyball.
Not sure about the guy on the left.

306
00:14:09,282 --> 00:14:10,917
[contestant] They're both hella built.

307
00:14:10,983 --> 00:14:12,085
Look at those shoulders.

308
00:14:12,685 --> 00:14:14,787
Lee Juyeong is really young, huh?

309
00:14:15,922 --> 00:14:17,490
I'm hyped for this one.

310
00:14:17,557 --> 00:14:19,425
This is gonna be fun.

311
00:14:19,926 --> 00:14:22,562
-This match has a real story behind it.
-[Dex] That's right.

312
00:14:23,129 --> 00:14:26,165
[Juyeong] Seeing Kim Minwoo

313
00:14:26,733 --> 00:14:28,034
got my blood boiling.

314
00:14:29,869 --> 00:14:31,738
[Lee] The survivor of this match is

315
00:14:31,804 --> 00:14:33,506
-Lee Juyeong.
-[cheers]

316
00:14:34,574 --> 00:14:35,742
Thank you, sir!

317
00:14:36,342 --> 00:14:37,443
Wait, hold on.

318
00:14:37,877 --> 00:14:39,946
Kim Minwoo from the red corner

319
00:14:40,012 --> 00:14:41,614
also survives.

320
00:14:42,315 --> 00:14:44,684
[Juyeong] Since we
both passed in that round,

321
00:14:45,184 --> 00:14:48,488
now it's either I get cut or he does.

322
00:14:49,489 --> 00:14:51,958
[Minwoo] All right,
let's fight for real this time.

323
00:14:52,558 --> 00:14:56,195
[Jongkook] Weight-wise,
Kim Hunsu's team has the advantage.

324
00:14:56,262 --> 00:14:59,399
Physically, they have the edge
but they lack experience.

325
00:15:00,366 --> 00:15:01,868
Let's see how this plays out.

326
00:15:02,635 --> 00:15:05,204
[announcer] First fighters,

327
00:15:05,271 --> 00:15:06,272
step in.

328
00:15:08,174 --> 00:15:09,575
The heavier guys are up first.

329
00:15:09,642 --> 00:15:11,110
RED CORNER R1 KIM HUNSU

330
00:15:12,245 --> 00:15:13,346
BLUE CORNER R1 LEE GIJUN

331
00:15:13,413 --> 00:15:15,281
[Jongkook] Okay, so it's these two first.

332
00:15:16,816 --> 00:15:18,117
The size difference is huge.

333
00:15:18,184 --> 00:15:19,318
Let's go, Kim Hunsu!

334
00:15:19,385 --> 00:15:22,088
[announcer] Let us begin the fight.

335
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:24,090
-Box!
-[bell dings]

336
00:15:24,157 --> 00:15:25,925
[contestants] Let's go!

337
00:15:25,992 --> 00:15:27,193
You got this, Lee Gijun!

338
00:15:27,727 --> 00:15:28,795
Let's go, Kim Hunsu!

339
00:15:28,861 --> 00:15:30,430
[contestant 3] Easy on the pressure.

340
00:15:33,466 --> 00:15:35,635
[contestant 4] Man, he's really tall.

341
00:15:37,370 --> 00:15:38,571
[contestant 5] That reach, though.

342
00:15:39,138 --> 00:15:41,073
This is basically fencing.

343
00:15:41,641 --> 00:15:43,309
[Hunsu] Since I've got more reach,

344
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:46,446
I figured I should use it to my advantage.

345
00:15:48,014 --> 00:15:49,015
Look at Kim Hunsu go!

346
00:15:49,081 --> 00:15:51,984
Kim Hunsu's punches
have real weight behind them.

347
00:15:52,051 --> 00:15:53,119
They're intimidating.

348
00:15:55,087 --> 00:15:57,390
[contestant] Gijun is looking
a bit stiff right now.

349
00:15:57,457 --> 00:15:58,925
It's the height difference.

350
00:16:00,793 --> 00:16:04,964
[Gijun] I wasn't expecting the volleyball
guy to be that good of a boxer.

351
00:16:06,132 --> 00:16:08,134
He kept throwing punches.

352
00:16:08,201 --> 00:16:09,602
I just couldn't settle in.

353
00:16:11,370 --> 00:16:12,972
He's too big to get in on easily.

354
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:14,807
[contestant 2] No need
to close the distance!

355
00:16:15,808 --> 00:16:18,010
[contestant 3] Go first!
Make the first move!

356
00:16:18,077 --> 00:16:20,880
-[contestant 4] Keep him at range!
-[contestant 5] Just keep your guard up.

357
00:16:21,814 --> 00:16:23,549
[Gijun] I'm like,
"Screw it. I'm going in."

358
00:16:24,784 --> 00:16:26,786
[contestants exclaiming]

359
00:16:30,923 --> 00:16:32,124
Keep going!

360
00:16:32,625 --> 00:16:34,126
Boy, he got caught.

361
00:16:35,027 --> 00:16:36,596
[Jongkook] Yes, that's how you go in.

362
00:16:36,662 --> 00:16:37,663
[contestant 1] That's it.

363
00:16:38,598 --> 00:16:39,599
Just swing!

364
00:16:43,536 --> 00:16:45,104
-Nice!
-That's it!

365
00:16:45,171 --> 00:16:46,973
[Juyeong] Keep your chin down, man!

366
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:48,941
[Dex] Kim Hunsu is coming at him hard.

367
00:16:49,475 --> 00:16:51,577
But Lee Gijun's not giving ground.

368
00:16:53,012 --> 00:16:54,347
[Minwoo] Gijun, pressure him!

369
00:16:56,148 --> 00:16:57,416
Good, keep it up!

370
00:17:00,286 --> 00:17:01,454
[contestant 1] All right!

371
00:17:01,521 --> 00:17:02,822
[Juyeong] Chin down! Chin down!

372
00:17:02,889 --> 00:17:03,990
[Dex] He's pressuring him hard!

373
00:17:05,124 --> 00:17:06,559
-[Juyeong] Your chin!
-[Dex] One minute!

374
00:17:06,626 --> 00:17:07,760
Tag out if you need to!

375
00:17:07,827 --> 00:17:09,362
-Tag out, man!
-Switch players.

376
00:17:09,428 --> 00:17:11,063
All right, you're up.

377
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:12,131
[referee] Stop!

378
00:17:13,633 --> 00:17:14,901
-They're switching.
-All right.

379
00:17:14,967 --> 00:17:16,602
RED CORNER SWITCH: LEE JUYEONG

380
00:17:16,669 --> 00:17:18,004
You can continue if you want.

381
00:17:18,638 --> 00:17:20,139
You good, Gijun? Okay.

382
00:17:20,206 --> 00:17:23,609
-Looks like Gijun chose not to tag out.
-[Jongkook] He's holding up well.

383
00:17:23,676 --> 00:17:25,378
[contestant] Wait, why didn't they switch?

384
00:17:25,978 --> 00:17:27,580
Nah, I think he's still good.

385
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:30,249
[Gijun] I wanted to save Minwoo's stamina,

386
00:17:30,316 --> 00:17:33,319
and I still had some energy left,

387
00:17:33,819 --> 00:17:35,388
-so I decided not to tag out.
-[bell dings]

388
00:17:35,454 --> 00:17:37,423
-Let's go, Gijun!
-Come this way, Gijun!

389
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:39,492
No, don't back up!

390
00:17:39,559 --> 00:17:41,060
[contestant 2] Connect your jab!

391
00:17:41,127 --> 00:17:42,128
[contestant 1] Don't back up!

392
00:17:42,194 --> 00:17:43,462
[contestant 3] That's it!

393
00:17:43,529 --> 00:17:46,032
[Gijun] My goal was to keep Juyeong moving

394
00:17:47,033 --> 00:17:49,468
and burn his stamina.

395
00:17:50,136 --> 00:17:51,504
Gijun, back up and breathe!

396
00:17:53,072 --> 00:17:54,206
[contestant 2] Press him!

397
00:17:54,774 --> 00:17:56,108
-Hound him!
-[contestant 3] Nice!

398
00:17:56,175 --> 00:17:58,177
[contestants exclaiming]

399
00:17:59,712 --> 00:18:01,147
Nice, Juyeong!

400
00:18:02,748 --> 00:18:04,150
Nice, Juyeong!

401
00:18:07,219 --> 00:18:08,688
Those shots are freaking loaded.

402
00:18:09,188 --> 00:18:10,389
He's not tiring out.

403
00:18:10,456 --> 00:18:12,291
[contestant 2] Gijun, get in there!

404
00:18:12,358 --> 00:18:13,459
Ten seconds!

405
00:18:13,993 --> 00:18:16,128
[contestant] Gijun, ease your way in.

406
00:18:16,195 --> 00:18:17,563
All right.

407
00:18:17,630 --> 00:18:18,864
Keep breathing, man.

408
00:18:19,999 --> 00:18:21,467
Stay calm, stay calm.

409
00:18:21,534 --> 00:18:22,935
Nice, nice, nice.

410
00:18:23,002 --> 00:18:25,037
LEE JUYEONG X LEE GIJUN

411
00:18:25,104 --> 00:18:26,472
-Stop!
-[Jongkook] Okay, time's up.

412
00:18:29,475 --> 00:18:30,910
He did all four minutes alone.

413
00:18:30,977 --> 00:18:32,278
Could be their strategy.

414
00:18:32,345 --> 00:18:34,280
Both guys from red are out of gas.

415
00:18:35,448 --> 00:18:38,351
This way,
Kim Minwoo got to save some energy.

416
00:18:38,417 --> 00:18:41,454
Red will probably send in Lee Juyeong.

417
00:18:42,088 --> 00:18:44,523
[contestant] Blue's definitely making
the switch now, right?

418
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:46,926
[announcer] Fighters, step in.

419
00:18:49,161 --> 00:18:50,663
[Lee] Red's sending out Lee Juyeong.

420
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:52,264
[Jongkook] Continuing from the last round.

421
00:18:53,499 --> 00:18:54,567
Whoa.

422
00:18:54,634 --> 00:18:55,835
[exclaims]

423
00:18:55,901 --> 00:18:57,203
He's going back in again?

424
00:18:59,438 --> 00:19:01,641
-They haven't switched either.
-It's Lee Gijun again?

425
00:19:01,707 --> 00:19:03,009
BLUE CORNER R2 LEE GIJUN

426
00:19:03,075 --> 00:19:05,645
This is definitely a strategy call.

427
00:19:05,711 --> 00:19:08,114
Looks like he's trying to run
until he's empty.

428
00:19:09,081 --> 00:19:11,784
[Gijun] First off,
I felt like I still had enough stamina,

429
00:19:11,851 --> 00:19:13,219
so I stepped back in.

430
00:19:13,853 --> 00:19:17,356
[Minwoo] The plan was to keep
one fighter fresh as long as we could.

431
00:19:17,423 --> 00:19:20,693
We figured managing our stamina smartly
could help us take the win,

432
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:23,195
so we had Gijun start things off.

433
00:19:23,929 --> 00:19:25,498
LEE JUYEONG X LEE GIJUN

434
00:19:25,564 --> 00:19:28,167
-[bell dings]
-They need to keep a cool head now.

435
00:19:28,234 --> 00:19:30,336
-Need to fight smart from here.
-[contestant] All right.

436
00:19:30,403 --> 00:19:31,804
Don't freeze up.

437
00:19:33,105 --> 00:19:35,107
[contestants exclaiming]

438
00:19:36,909 --> 00:19:37,910
That's a clean hit.

439
00:19:38,377 --> 00:19:39,912
He tossed an uppercut like that?

440
00:19:41,347 --> 00:19:42,948
-[Minwoo] Strike!
-[Hunsu] Notch it down a bit.

441
00:19:43,482 --> 00:19:44,817
[contestants] This is it! Yes!

442
00:19:44,884 --> 00:19:46,318
[exclaims]

443
00:19:47,319 --> 00:19:48,521
[contestant 1] Counter… No!

444
00:19:48,587 --> 00:19:50,056
[contestant 2] How is he so good?

445
00:19:50,122 --> 00:19:51,457
[contestant 3] His stamina is crazy.

446
00:19:51,524 --> 00:19:53,259
-Fix your stance!
-All right!

447
00:19:53,325 --> 00:19:54,760
[contestant 7] Did you see that footwork?

448
00:19:56,762 --> 00:19:58,464
He's moving really well.

449
00:19:58,531 --> 00:20:00,800
Looks like Lee Gijun still has gas.

450
00:20:00,866 --> 00:20:01,967
Hang tough, man!

451
00:20:05,037 --> 00:20:06,672
[Juyeong] I was like, "Wow, he's strong."

452
00:20:06,739 --> 00:20:08,574
"He's stronger than I expected."

453
00:20:08,641 --> 00:20:10,810
[contestant] Remember, pace yourself.

454
00:20:11,844 --> 00:20:14,613
-[Dex] Wait, I think he's bleeding a bit.
-[Jongkook] Yeah, he is.

455
00:20:18,117 --> 00:20:19,618
[contestant 3] He's getting worked up.

456
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:22,154
Stay calm, stay calm.

457
00:20:24,724 --> 00:20:25,891
BLUE CORNER SWITCH: KIM MINWOO

458
00:20:25,958 --> 00:20:27,159
-[exclaiming]
-Tag out, tag out.

459
00:20:28,694 --> 00:20:30,329
He's finally tagging out.

460
00:20:30,396 --> 00:20:31,564
[contestant 3] Smart strategy.

461
00:20:32,164 --> 00:20:33,332
[Hunsu] Relax, relax.

462
00:20:33,933 --> 00:20:34,934
We're doing good.

463
00:20:36,936 --> 00:20:40,506
[Juyeong] When Minwoo came in,
I thought, "Let's settle this for good."

464
00:20:42,408 --> 00:20:43,909
All right, let's go.

465
00:20:43,976 --> 00:20:45,644
[Juyeong] I think I got a bit fired up.

466
00:20:48,414 --> 00:20:50,549
[Minwoo] "Come on,
let's fight for real now."

467
00:20:51,650 --> 00:20:52,885
[referee] All right, let's go.

468
00:20:53,719 --> 00:20:55,254
-Box!
-[contestant 1] Let's go!

469
00:20:55,321 --> 00:20:58,557
LEE JUYEONG X KIM MINWOO

470
00:20:58,624 --> 00:21:00,226
[contestant 2] See that opening, yeah?

471
00:21:00,292 --> 00:21:02,361
[contestants exclaiming]

472
00:21:07,633 --> 00:21:09,435
[Dex] Lee Juyeong's losing his cool a bit.

473
00:21:10,703 --> 00:21:13,439
You know how it is,
people kind of snap when they smell blood.

474
00:21:17,276 --> 00:21:19,445
[contestant] Oh, no. He's losing his cool.

475
00:21:21,514 --> 00:21:23,048
Relax, man!

476
00:21:23,115 --> 00:21:24,450
You have to stay calm!

477
00:21:31,590 --> 00:21:32,825
[contestant 1] He's pissed.

478
00:21:32,892 --> 00:21:34,660
[contestant 2] I think
they should switch him out.

479
00:21:34,727 --> 00:21:36,762
-[contestant 1] He's getting greedy.
-Hey, tag out!

480
00:21:36,829 --> 00:21:37,963
Tag out, Juyeong!

481
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,632
Tag out! Tag out!

482
00:21:39,698 --> 00:21:41,901
-Juyeong, you need to tag out!
-Switch, switch!

483
00:21:42,902 --> 00:21:44,603
[contestant 2] He's not letting
that happen.

484
00:21:46,906 --> 00:21:48,707
He's not letting that happen.

485
00:21:48,774 --> 00:21:50,643
[contestant 3] He won't let him tag out.

486
00:21:51,610 --> 00:21:53,412
You could say this is a strategy move.

487
00:21:55,014 --> 00:21:56,916
[contestant 4] Lee Juyeong can't switch
out now.

488
00:21:57,716 --> 00:22:00,219
This has turned into
a pride thing for him.

489
00:22:00,753 --> 00:22:02,922
-Get back in for the last round.
-You gotta win this.

490
00:22:02,988 --> 00:22:04,023
Switch, switch!

491
00:22:05,457 --> 00:22:06,492
[contestant 7] Tag out!

492
00:22:06,559 --> 00:22:08,060
Use that rule to your advantage!

493
00:22:08,561 --> 00:22:10,262
[Juyeong] I think I got too worked up.

494
00:22:11,297 --> 00:22:14,400
The fight just wasn't going my way.

495
00:22:16,235 --> 00:22:17,236
[contestant] Yes, that's it!

496
00:22:18,904 --> 00:22:20,105
He's getting dragged.

497
00:22:20,172 --> 00:22:21,974
[contestant 2] Juyeong, get out of there!

498
00:22:22,041 --> 00:22:23,342
You have to tag out now!

499
00:22:23,409 --> 00:22:24,844
[Jongkook] He needs to extend further.

500
00:22:24,910 --> 00:22:27,046
-Further, extend further.
-[contestant 3] Upper to the body!

501
00:22:27,112 --> 00:22:28,180
He's staying on him.

502
00:22:29,114 --> 00:22:30,649
[contestants exclaim]

503
00:22:30,716 --> 00:22:32,251
[exclaims]

504
00:22:32,318 --> 00:22:33,552
Stay calm!

505
00:22:34,987 --> 00:22:38,257
-All right! That's it!
-[contestant 1] Come, come, come!

506
00:22:38,324 --> 00:22:39,458
[contestant 2] All right!

507
00:22:39,525 --> 00:22:41,560
-[Dex] He blocked the tag!
-[Jongkook] No, he tagged out.

508
00:22:41,627 --> 00:22:42,628
[Lee] All right!

509
00:22:42,695 --> 00:22:44,396
-He blocked the tag!
-No, he tagged out.

510
00:22:45,097 --> 00:22:46,098
[contestant 1] Let's go!

511
00:22:46,765 --> 00:22:48,534
[contestant 2] Just endure this round.

512
00:22:48,601 --> 00:22:50,603
[contestant 3] This should be fun.
The heavyweights.

513
00:22:50,669 --> 00:22:52,938
[Jongkook] They have to go for it now.

514
00:22:53,472 --> 00:22:54,540
They can't stall here.

515
00:22:54,607 --> 00:22:56,175
-Not long now, man!
-[exclaiming]

516
00:22:56,242 --> 00:22:57,409
[contestant 5] Yes, that's it!

517
00:22:57,476 --> 00:22:58,577
-Nice move!
-Go in!

518
00:22:58,644 --> 00:23:00,279
No, you have to keep going!

519
00:23:01,513 --> 00:23:03,082
[Sungmin] Keep going!

520
00:23:05,150 --> 00:23:06,252
[contestants] All right!

521
00:23:08,988 --> 00:23:10,823
He's getting clipped
by those random swings.

522
00:23:11,857 --> 00:23:12,858
All right, the head!

523
00:23:12,925 --> 00:23:14,093
[contestant 4] Load it up!

524
00:23:14,159 --> 00:23:15,527
-Hunsu, don't stop!
-Push forward!

525
00:23:15,961 --> 00:23:17,596
[Jongkook] The height difference works.

526
00:23:17,663 --> 00:23:18,664
[contestant 6] Get in there!

527
00:23:19,899 --> 00:23:21,800
Kim Hunsu has the heart of a warrior,

528
00:23:21,867 --> 00:23:23,235
although he may lack technique.

529
00:23:23,702 --> 00:23:24,970
[contestant 1] Power through!

530
00:23:25,037 --> 00:23:27,406
[contestants exclaiming]

531
00:23:27,473 --> 00:23:28,741
[exclaims]

532
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:33,545
[Dex] Kim Hunsu's got
real animal instinct.

533
00:23:35,848 --> 00:23:37,816
[contestant 2] As expected
from a heavyweight.

534
00:23:39,919 --> 00:23:43,055
-Those wild shots are somehow landing.
-[bell dings]

535
00:23:43,122 --> 00:23:44,924
-[referee] Stop!
-[contestant 1] Okay, round over.

536
00:23:46,025 --> 00:23:47,593
[contestant 3] This tag match is fun.

537
00:23:47,660 --> 00:23:49,395
[contestant 4] It really is. [chuckles]

538
00:23:49,461 --> 00:23:51,664
This one's
seriously entertaining. [chuckles]

539
00:23:51,730 --> 00:23:53,799
Wow. [chuckles]

540
00:23:53,866 --> 00:23:56,435
-This is gonna be a tough call.
-[Dex] Right?

541
00:23:56,502 --> 00:23:58,237
[Juyeong] Looks
like Kim Minwoo is spent now.

542
00:23:58,304 --> 00:23:59,605
Gijun will probably step back in.

543
00:24:00,739 --> 00:24:02,975
I got too worked up earlier.
I couldn't stick to my style.

544
00:24:03,042 --> 00:24:04,376
Yeah. You go first.

545
00:24:04,443 --> 00:24:07,179
I'll take the first half of this round.

546
00:24:07,646 --> 00:24:08,814
Cool your head for now.

547
00:24:08,881 --> 00:24:10,516
-Go slow and stay composed.
-Okay.

548
00:24:11,083 --> 00:24:13,285
[announcer] Fighters, step in.

549
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:16,322
[Lee] Who's stepping in? Oh, I see.

550
00:24:18,524 --> 00:24:19,758
[contestant] Let's go!

551
00:24:19,825 --> 00:24:22,428
[Dex] Blue corner is letting
Gijun rest more.

552
00:24:23,929 --> 00:24:27,266
RED CORNER R3 LEE JUYEONG

553
00:24:29,101 --> 00:24:30,436
Man, this is intense.

554
00:24:32,037 --> 00:24:33,305
-These two again?
-Toe-to-toe?

555
00:24:33,372 --> 00:24:34,373
[chuckles]

556
00:24:35,374 --> 00:24:36,742
He's already getting heated.

557
00:24:37,743 --> 00:24:40,145
[contestant 2] Remember,
keep your head cool.

558
00:24:42,715 --> 00:24:45,851
[Minwoo] Lee Juyeong was staring
holes through me.

559
00:24:45,918 --> 00:24:47,386
Guess he wanted to get right into it.

560
00:24:47,453 --> 00:24:48,554
[contestant] Stay calm!

561
00:24:49,355 --> 00:24:51,090
-[Juyeong] Bring it.
-[bell dings]

562
00:24:51,156 --> 00:24:52,624
[Juyeong] I won't back off an inch.

563
00:24:52,691 --> 00:24:54,159
-Let's go!
-Let's go, Juyeong!

564
00:24:55,494 --> 00:24:56,862
[Gijun] Remember, it's the last round.

565
00:24:56,929 --> 00:24:57,930
-[bell dings]
-Last round!

566
00:24:57,997 --> 00:24:59,531
-Box!
-[contestants] Last round!

567
00:24:59,598 --> 00:25:00,866
[Jongkook] Yes, drive it in there.

568
00:25:00,933 --> 00:25:02,968
-[contestant] All right!
-[Jongkook] That's it!

569
00:25:03,035 --> 00:25:05,337
Stay calm! It's okay! Just stay calm!

570
00:25:05,804 --> 00:25:07,573
[Jongkook] That's it! Smother him!

571
00:25:08,407 --> 00:25:09,975
-All right!
-Juyeong, doing good!

572
00:25:10,042 --> 00:25:11,643
-That's it!
-Stay calm!

573
00:25:12,411 --> 00:25:13,746
[contestant 5] Don't get too heated.

574
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:15,848
[contestant 6] Just do
what you're thinking.

575
00:25:15,914 --> 00:25:16,915
[contestant 7] Nice shot.

576
00:25:16,982 --> 00:25:19,251
-[contestant 8] Relax, keep it cool!
-[contestants] Oh, whoa!

577
00:25:19,852 --> 00:25:21,086
He's getting too worked up.

578
00:25:22,154 --> 00:25:24,189
[contestant 9] You need insane stamina
to keep that up.

579
00:25:26,859 --> 00:25:27,926
[Jongkook] Nice body shot.

580
00:25:27,993 --> 00:25:29,128
Nice left punch.

581
00:25:29,194 --> 00:25:30,429
[Hunsu] Stay calm!

582
00:25:30,496 --> 00:25:32,531
-Nice! Yes, this is it!
-[contestants exclaiming]

583
00:25:32,598 --> 00:25:34,933
Lee Juyeong's specialty is the left hook.

584
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,035
[Hunsu] Stay calm!

585
00:25:40,773 --> 00:25:42,307
Careful, careful.

586
00:25:42,374 --> 00:25:43,442
Tell me if you're tired.

587
00:25:48,747 --> 00:25:50,716
[Dex] He's settling down now.

588
00:25:50,783 --> 00:25:52,117
[contestant 1] Wow, he's taunting him.

589
00:26:01,260 --> 00:26:02,895
[Dex laughs, exclaims]

590
00:26:02,961 --> 00:26:05,564
Juyeong has a bit of crazy in him,
doesn't he? [chuckles]

591
00:26:05,631 --> 00:26:06,632
He sure does.

592
00:26:06,698 --> 00:26:09,134
"Oh, you hit me? Come here, you."

593
00:26:09,201 --> 00:26:11,336
He's feeding off it to go even harder.

594
00:26:14,740 --> 00:26:15,741
Take your shot, man!

595
00:26:20,179 --> 00:26:21,947
[contestants exclaiming]

596
00:26:22,014 --> 00:26:23,248
[contestant 1] He's real fiery.

597
00:26:23,315 --> 00:26:26,452
[Dex] Unless someone gets knocked out
here, this is going to be tough to judge.

598
00:26:28,654 --> 00:26:30,055
[contestant 2] This is scary.

599
00:26:30,556 --> 00:26:31,824
[contestant 3] Go in further!

600
00:26:32,291 --> 00:26:34,226
[Minwoo] I was debating
whether to match his intensity

601
00:26:34,293 --> 00:26:36,428
or stick to a smart
hit-and-switch strategy.

602
00:26:38,430 --> 00:26:40,799
Come, let's switch.

603
00:26:41,733 --> 00:26:42,734
Come.

604
00:26:43,602 --> 00:26:45,737
-[Lee] They're switching.
-[contestant 1] Smart move.

605
00:26:45,804 --> 00:26:47,639
BLUE CORNER LAST FIGHTER:
LEE GIJUN

606
00:26:48,340 --> 00:26:49,408
They're switching too.

607
00:26:50,742 --> 00:26:52,478
RED CORNER LAST FIGHTER:
KIM HUNSU

608
00:26:52,544 --> 00:26:54,980
[contestant 3 gasps] This is gonna be
the deciding moment.

609
00:26:55,047 --> 00:26:56,315
All right, let's go!

610
00:26:57,116 --> 00:26:58,917
Okay, box!

611
00:26:58,984 --> 00:27:00,652
[contestant 1] Just do
what you've been doing.

612
00:27:00,719 --> 00:27:01,720
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

613
00:27:01,787 --> 00:27:04,089
[Lee] Gijun's coming in fresh now.

614
00:27:04,156 --> 00:27:05,791
[Jongkook] He's back in with fresh legs.

615
00:27:06,892 --> 00:27:10,395
[Dex] But Kim Hunsu is no joke either.
He's strong, and he's got a solid chin.

616
00:27:11,997 --> 00:27:14,266
Gijun, try fighting closer now!

617
00:27:14,333 --> 00:27:16,268
[contestant 2] You've got
to keep it calm! Relax!

618
00:27:16,335 --> 00:27:17,336
[contestant 3] Slow down!

619
00:27:17,970 --> 00:27:20,038
[contestant 4] Watch his lower hand.

620
00:27:20,639 --> 00:27:22,307
[Jongkook] Guard up, guard up.

621
00:27:22,374 --> 00:27:24,510
Kim Hunsu's guard is dropping way too low.

622
00:27:25,544 --> 00:27:26,545
Watch his lower hand.

623
00:27:28,247 --> 00:27:30,015
[Jongkook] He's gotta step
in and throw now.

624
00:27:30,082 --> 00:27:31,216
But with this size gap…

625
00:27:31,283 --> 00:27:32,584
Yeah, no way that reaches.

626
00:27:33,185 --> 00:27:34,386
Throw one at a time.

627
00:27:34,453 --> 00:27:36,555
[contestant 2] Okay, hit and move!

628
00:27:36,622 --> 00:27:38,790
[contestants exclaiming]

629
00:27:39,324 --> 00:27:40,492
He caught him!

630
00:27:42,461 --> 00:27:43,562
That was an overhand!

631
00:27:44,630 --> 00:27:49,268
-Fake low, then throw the overhand up top.
-[cheers]

632
00:27:49,334 --> 00:27:50,702
[Minuk] His overhand keeps landing.

633
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:52,437
Because the guard is down.

634
00:27:52,504 --> 00:27:54,139
Yeah, it's completely down.

635
00:27:55,774 --> 00:27:57,109
Just do what you did earlier.

636
00:27:58,443 --> 00:27:59,478
Yes, just like that!

637
00:28:00,879 --> 00:28:03,448
[contestant 1] Okay! Okay!

638
00:28:03,515 --> 00:28:05,250
[exclaiming]

639
00:28:05,317 --> 00:28:06,618
That shot did real damage!

640
00:28:06,685 --> 00:28:07,986
He felt that one!

641
00:28:08,654 --> 00:28:10,155
Hey, stay calm, stay calm!

642
00:28:11,223 --> 00:28:13,125
-Deep breaths!
-[contestant 2] He's loosened up now.

643
00:28:13,192 --> 00:28:14,326
You can't beat him now.

644
00:28:17,930 --> 00:28:20,265
-[contestant 3] There you go!
-[contestant 4] How is he so good?

645
00:28:21,767 --> 00:28:22,935
[grunting]

646
00:28:23,001 --> 00:28:24,570
[contestant 3] All right!

647
00:28:25,604 --> 00:28:27,439
All right, do everything you want!

648
00:28:27,506 --> 00:28:28,840
Anything you want, Gijun!

649
00:28:28,907 --> 00:28:30,275
[grunting continues]

650
00:28:30,342 --> 00:28:31,343
Wait, that's too--

651
00:28:31,410 --> 00:28:32,444
[contestant 4] There you go!

652
00:28:35,847 --> 00:28:37,382
[contestant 5]
Give it everything you've got!

653
00:28:37,916 --> 00:28:39,518
-Okay, last one!
-Ten seconds!

654
00:28:40,018 --> 00:28:41,820
[contestant 6] One last time! Ten seconds!

655
00:28:41,887 --> 00:28:43,889
Ten seconds!

656
00:28:44,389 --> 00:28:45,390
Keep throwing!

657
00:28:45,457 --> 00:28:47,326
-[contestant 1] Come on!
-[grunting, groaning]

658
00:28:47,392 --> 00:28:49,261
[contestant 2] Okay, last one!

659
00:28:49,328 --> 00:28:50,829
-[contestant 3] Let's go!
-Go for it!

660
00:28:50,896 --> 00:28:52,064
-Stop!
-[contestant 4] All right!

661
00:28:52,130 --> 00:28:53,131
[contestant cheering]

662
00:28:53,198 --> 00:28:54,600
-Wow.
-Man, that was good.

663
00:28:55,801 --> 00:28:57,069
[Lee] Well fought.

664
00:28:57,135 --> 00:28:58,737
[chattering]

665
00:28:58,804 --> 00:29:00,105
Lee Gijun's real good.

666
00:29:00,672 --> 00:29:02,708
I mean, what a fight! [chuckles]

667
00:29:02,774 --> 00:29:05,811
Lee Gijun held his ground so well.

668
00:29:05,877 --> 00:29:07,779
-That was amazing.
-Yeah, they were great.

669
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:09,881
[contestant 1] You two did great!

670
00:29:09,948 --> 00:29:11,383
You guys were awesome!

671
00:29:11,450 --> 00:29:13,685
[Lee] The winners of this match are…

672
00:29:15,254 --> 00:29:17,990
[contestant 7] If he stayed a bit calmer,
he might've done even better.

673
00:29:18,757 --> 00:29:20,459
[contestant 8] Blue takes this.

674
00:29:21,660 --> 00:29:24,329
[Hunsu]
It's bittersweet, but I feel relieved too.

675
00:29:24,963 --> 00:29:27,499
I think I showed everything I had.

676
00:29:28,333 --> 00:29:31,436
[Minwoo] I thought we had this one.

677
00:29:34,673 --> 00:29:37,643
[Lee] Lee Gijun and Kim Minwoo
from the blue corner.

678
00:29:37,709 --> 00:29:39,511
-[contestant 1] Yeah!
-[contestant 2] That was sick!

679
00:29:39,578 --> 00:29:41,413
-[contestant 3] Good game.
-[contestant 2] Well fought!

680
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:45,751
But honestly, Lee Juyeong,
the performance you put on in that ring…

681
00:29:45,817 --> 00:29:49,354
I'm older than you, but man…
What you showed in there was impressive.

682
00:29:49,421 --> 00:29:50,422
Thank you.

683
00:29:50,922 --> 00:29:52,224
The truth is,

684
00:29:53,325 --> 00:29:55,294
I haven't trained properly lately.

685
00:29:56,361 --> 00:29:59,197
It's been maybe a month and a half.

686
00:30:01,900 --> 00:30:03,268
I kind of…

687
00:30:03,769 --> 00:30:05,504
Well, I hit a slump.

688
00:30:05,570 --> 00:30:07,873
And I just started living alone in Seoul.

689
00:30:08,473 --> 00:30:11,076
So my rent
is a bit overdue too. [chuckles]

690
00:30:11,143 --> 00:30:12,411
[chuckles]

691
00:30:15,180 --> 00:30:17,282
I need to make money,
but work's hard to find.

692
00:30:18,917 --> 00:30:21,953
I've been going through
a major slump in boxing.

693
00:30:23,755 --> 00:30:28,360
I probably sent over 50 part-time
job applications in a week.

694
00:30:28,860 --> 00:30:31,496
No one wanted to hire me,
because I'm a middle school grad.

695
00:30:32,064 --> 00:30:33,799
People keep telling me,

696
00:30:34,566 --> 00:30:38,070
"It'd be a waste if you quit boxing."

697
00:30:38,136 --> 00:30:41,106
But I still need to eat to survive.

698
00:30:42,874 --> 00:30:47,012
So, I've really been debating
whether to continue or not…

699
00:30:49,548 --> 00:30:50,816
[sighs]

700
00:30:50,882 --> 00:30:51,983
But I want to keep going.

701
00:30:52,050 --> 00:30:53,852
[breathing heavily]

702
00:30:56,555 --> 00:30:58,090
[contestants, judges] Aw.

703
00:30:59,257 --> 00:31:01,059
That's the spirit!

704
00:31:01,126 --> 00:31:02,894
Man, I'm tearing up.

705
00:31:04,896 --> 00:31:05,897
You're awesome.

706
00:31:09,601 --> 00:31:11,136
[contestants chattering]

707
00:31:11,636 --> 00:31:15,907
[narrator] When your name is called,
please step into the ring.

708
00:31:16,408 --> 00:31:18,944
Park Youngho and Shin Donghyun.

709
00:31:19,010 --> 00:31:20,412
[cheering]

710
00:31:20,912 --> 00:31:23,081
-[contestant 2] Go get 'em!
-[contestant 3] Let's go, man!

711
00:31:23,682 --> 00:31:25,384
[cheering continues]

712
00:31:25,450 --> 00:31:26,818
PARK YOUNGHO, SHIN DONGHYUN

713
00:31:26,885 --> 00:31:28,120
[Dex] This team's a strong pair.

714
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,989
[Jongkook] Shin Donghyun is no joke.

715
00:31:31,056 --> 00:31:32,824
He's signed with O*E Championship.

716
00:31:32,891 --> 00:31:34,993
-Right, he's the first Korean to do it.
-[Jongkook] Mmm.

717
00:31:35,060 --> 00:31:38,163
I'm sure he got signed for a reason.

718
00:31:38,663 --> 00:31:41,833
-And Park Youngho's body is insane.
-[Jongkook] That's right.

719
00:31:41,900 --> 00:31:43,902
[Lee]
He won the fitness model championship.

720
00:31:45,103 --> 00:31:46,872
[contestant 1] Damn,
he's gonna be tough to break.

721
00:31:46,938 --> 00:31:48,039
[contestants laugh]

722
00:31:48,106 --> 00:31:49,608
[narrator] Red corner,

723
00:31:49,674 --> 00:31:52,511
Ko Yohan and Kim Dongeon.

724
00:31:53,011 --> 00:31:54,346
-All right!
-Let's go!

725
00:31:54,413 --> 00:31:55,414
You got this!

726
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:57,349
[contestant 2]
Show them how outboxing is done!

727
00:31:57,416 --> 00:31:59,151
[Jihyeok] Know anything about that guy?

728
00:31:59,718 --> 00:32:00,819
[Seongjun] Oh, you mean Ko Yohan?

729
00:32:01,686 --> 00:32:02,754
Not a clue.

730
00:32:03,288 --> 00:32:04,489
Is he a pro athlete?

731
00:32:05,223 --> 00:32:07,626
[Lee] Kim Dongeon. An elite boxer.

732
00:32:07,692 --> 00:32:09,561
A high school student and a bus driver.

733
00:32:09,628 --> 00:32:11,329
KIM DONGEON, KO YOHAN

734
00:32:11,763 --> 00:32:13,698
DURING THE TAG RING TEAM FORMATION

735
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:16,601
May I ask what sport you do?

736
00:32:16,668 --> 00:32:18,103
