00:41:57,348 --> 00:41:59,250
-Nice.
-[contestant 8] You're awesome, Dongeon!

979
00:41:59,851 --> 00:42:00,852
You're the man!

980
00:42:01,619 --> 00:42:03,921
-[contestant 9] Hold, now strike.
-[grunting, groaning]

981
00:42:05,957 --> 00:42:08,226
-Did he get groggy just now?
-[contestant exclaiming]

982
00:42:08,292 --> 00:42:09,293
[contestant 3] He's gassed out.

983
00:42:09,360 --> 00:42:11,329
[contestant 7]
Tag out! You need to tag out now!

984
00:42:11,996 --> 00:42:13,031
-You good?
-Yeah.

985
00:42:13,564 --> 00:42:14,632
-[Jaehyuk] What?
-[Seungjun] Huh?

986
00:42:14,699 --> 00:42:16,434
[both laugh]

987
00:42:18,169 --> 00:42:19,170
-You good?
-Yeah.

988
00:42:19,237 --> 00:42:20,471
-You good?
-Yeah, I'm fine.

989
00:42:20,538 --> 00:42:21,706
-Thanks.
-No problem.

990
00:42:22,774 --> 00:42:25,143
-What? Why didn't he put his fist out?
-[laughs]

991
00:42:25,209 --> 00:42:26,544
Why'd he pretend not to see it?

992
00:42:26,611 --> 00:42:28,246
-All right!
-Nice, let's go!

993
00:42:28,746 --> 00:42:30,848
[contestant 1] He still
hasn't caught his breath. [laughs]

994
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:35,019
He wanted out,
so I couldn't just ignore him.

995
00:42:35,787 --> 00:42:38,923
So I figured I'd just finish strong.

996
00:42:40,291 --> 00:42:41,526
Honestly, I was thinking,

997
00:42:41,592 --> 00:42:43,995
"All boxing-related titles aside,
I can't possibly

998
00:42:45,196 --> 00:42:46,697
lose to a high schooler.

999
00:42:46,764 --> 00:42:49,233
I've got 20 years on this kid.

1000
00:42:49,300 --> 00:42:52,403
No way I'm taking shots
from a teen." [chuckles]

1001
00:42:52,470 --> 00:42:53,871
[contestants cheering]

1002
00:42:54,505 --> 00:42:56,374
KIM DONGEON - PARK YOUNGHO

1003
00:42:56,441 --> 00:42:59,444
-[in English] Box!
-[contestants cheering]

1004
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:04,882
[Dex, in Korean] Look at him charge in
with his guard up!

1005
00:43:05,583 --> 00:43:07,118
There's just no way around that!

1006
00:43:07,185 --> 00:43:08,419
[Jongkook] Wow, look at that.

1007
00:43:08,486 --> 00:43:10,054
-That's insane.
-[contestant 1] What's happening?

1008
00:43:10,121 --> 00:43:11,122
[contestant 2] Nice move!

1009
00:43:11,189 --> 00:43:12,757
[contestant 3]
Just steamroll him, Youngho!

1010
00:43:16,094 --> 00:43:17,528
[Jongkook] He looks rattled.

1011
00:43:17,595 --> 00:43:18,963
He's panicking.

1012
00:43:20,598 --> 00:43:22,400
[Dongeon] Because of the size
and strength difference,

1013
00:43:22,467 --> 00:43:27,872
I was trying to figure out how to work
the fight the whole time I was in there.

1014
00:43:27,939 --> 00:43:30,541
If I went up too close,
I'd get overpowered,

1015
00:43:30,608 --> 00:43:33,444
so I tried to keep a distance
and pick him off clean.

1016
00:43:33,511 --> 00:43:36,547
-[clamoring]
-[contestant 1] Stay calm! That's it!

1017
00:43:36,614 --> 00:43:37,782
That's right!

1018
00:43:39,217 --> 00:43:40,451
[contestant 2] All right!

1019
00:43:40,952 --> 00:43:44,455
[Lee] Dongeon's managing
his distance fairly well.

1020
00:43:46,324 --> 00:43:48,159
[Youngho] He was quick on his feet.

1021
00:43:48,693 --> 00:43:51,696
I kept going though, thinking
one would land eventually. [chuckles]

1022
00:43:54,866 --> 00:43:56,567
[contestant 3]
Damn, those shots are lethal.

1023
00:43:59,971 --> 00:44:01,839
[Dex] Dongeon, pour it all out!

1024
00:44:02,340 --> 00:44:03,608
You have to give it all!

1025
00:44:04,242 --> 00:44:06,511
I'm like his mom now.
This is driving me nuts.

1026
00:44:10,615 --> 00:44:12,183
[contestant 4] He's like a boulder.

1027
00:44:12,683 --> 00:44:15,219
-He's not taking any damage at all.
-[grunting, groaning]

1028
00:44:15,286 --> 00:44:18,055
-Okay, ten seconds, Dongeon!
-[contestants cheering]

1029
00:44:18,122 --> 00:44:20,591
KIM DONGEON X PARK YOUNGHO

1030
00:44:20,658 --> 00:44:22,393
-[Lee] He's panicking right now.
-[grunts]

1031
00:44:22,460 --> 00:44:24,295
[Jongkook]
He's taking everything like nothing.

1032
00:44:24,362 --> 00:44:26,264
-Stop!
-[bell rings]

1033
00:44:26,330 --> 00:44:27,331
[contestant exclaims]

1034
00:44:27,398 --> 00:44:29,967
-[contestant 5] Nice going!
-He's got guts, all right.

1035
00:44:30,968 --> 00:44:32,770
[Dex] Damn, that power…

1036
00:44:33,938 --> 00:44:35,873
Those two have
a 26-kilogram weight difference.

1037
00:44:35,940 --> 00:44:36,974
[chuckling] Damn.

1038
00:44:37,041 --> 00:44:39,677
Park Youngho just needs to
charge forward like this.

1039
00:44:39,744 --> 00:44:41,913
Then everything just bounces off him.

1040
00:44:41,979 --> 00:44:44,048
He's double his size and age.

1041
00:44:44,115 --> 00:44:45,449
-[Dex] Yeah, you're right.
-Yeah.

1042
00:44:47,151 --> 00:44:48,386
[contestant laughs]

1043
00:44:50,354 --> 00:44:54,225
I knew Kim Dongeon
wouldn't land on me easily,

1044
00:44:54,292 --> 00:44:56,360
but I wasn't going to land
on him easily either.

1045
00:44:57,795 --> 00:45:03,201
So, given the weight difference
between the two,

1046
00:45:03,801 --> 00:45:08,739
the strategy was to have Youngho
stay on Dongeon and shut him out.

1047
00:45:11,309 --> 00:45:13,511
Here's the game plan.

1048
00:45:14,011 --> 00:45:16,314
Just hold out as much as you can.

1049
00:45:16,781 --> 00:45:17,915
I'll score the points.

1050
00:45:17,982 --> 00:45:19,016
Got it.

1051
00:45:21,652 --> 00:45:23,921
We can do this. We can do this.

1052
00:45:24,455 --> 00:45:26,657
[narrator] Fighters, step in.

1053
00:45:28,159 --> 00:45:29,193
Who will enter first?

1054
00:45:29,727 --> 00:45:31,762
Just stall him and keep countering.

1055
00:45:33,931 --> 00:45:35,833
[contestant 1] Yohan's going first again.

1056
00:45:36,667 --> 00:45:37,668
Let's do this.

1057
00:45:38,202 --> 00:45:39,937
Go give him a bus ride. [laughs]

1058
00:45:40,438 --> 00:45:41,772
"Give him a bus ride."

1059
00:45:41,839 --> 00:45:43,374
[Dex] It's Shin Donghyun from blue!

1060
00:45:43,441 --> 00:45:46,077
BLUE CORNER R3 SHIN DONGHYUN

1061
00:45:46,944 --> 00:45:48,112
[bell rings]

1062
00:45:48,179 --> 00:45:50,114
KO YOHAN X SHIN DONGHYUN

1063
00:45:50,181 --> 00:45:51,215
-Box!
-[exclaims]

1064
00:45:51,282 --> 00:45:53,184
-[contestant 1] Let's go!
-[contestant 2] Last round!

1065
00:45:58,089 --> 00:46:00,057
Let's get him on that ambulance!

1066
00:46:01,058 --> 00:46:02,260
Remember, one-two hook!

1067
00:46:02,326 --> 00:46:03,894
One-two hook!

1068
00:46:05,963 --> 00:46:07,865
[contestant 3] He swung the other way!

1069
00:46:07,932 --> 00:46:10,034
He did it the other way round.

1070
00:46:12,370 --> 00:46:16,307
Shin Donghyun definitely
has that fighter instinct.

1071
00:46:16,374 --> 00:46:17,675
[contestants] All right!

1072
00:46:17,742 --> 00:46:19,010
[contestant 4] Match him!

1073
00:46:19,076 --> 00:46:21,178
-[grunting, groaning]
-[contestants shouting]

1074
00:46:21,679 --> 00:46:22,847
[contestant 4] Yes, that's it!

1075
00:46:22,913 --> 00:46:24,849
-Nice!
-Drop him!

1076
00:46:24,915 --> 00:46:25,916
Knock him down!

1077
00:46:27,184 --> 00:46:28,486
[shouting continues]

1078
00:46:30,521 --> 00:46:32,189
Let's go, Ko Yohan!

1079
00:46:32,256 --> 00:46:33,257
Stay confident!

1080
00:46:33,324 --> 00:46:34,959
Yohan, go! Strike first!

1081
00:46:35,026 --> 00:46:36,727
Yohan, just strike first!

1082
00:46:38,062 --> 00:46:40,464
[contestant 5] Jeez, he can't get in.

1083
00:46:41,465 --> 00:46:43,434
His opponent's looking way too relaxed.

1084
00:46:44,502 --> 00:46:45,970
[Shin Donghyun sighs]

1085
00:46:46,037 --> 00:46:47,138
Chicken much?

1086
00:46:53,010 --> 00:46:55,513
[grunting]

1087
00:46:55,579 --> 00:46:57,348
-[exclaiming]
-[grunting, groaning]

1088
00:46:58,683 --> 00:47:00,384
Let's go, bus driver!

1089
00:47:00,885 --> 00:47:02,653
I thought he'd drop right away,

1090
00:47:02,720 --> 00:47:05,189
but he held out way better
than I expected.

1091
00:47:05,256 --> 00:47:06,390
I'll give him that.

1092
00:47:10,294 --> 00:47:11,862
[contestant 1] Wait, what's he up to?

1093
00:47:11,929 --> 00:47:13,331
[contestant 2] Is he loading up or what?

1094
00:47:13,397 --> 00:47:15,032
Watch out for the back hand.

1095
00:47:15,099 --> 00:47:17,101
[Jongkook] He's gonna throw that left.

1096
00:47:17,168 --> 00:47:18,703
-[contestant 3] Okay, go!
-[contestant 4] Strike!

1097
00:47:19,670 --> 00:47:21,505
[contestant 5] He needs to tag out.

1098
00:47:21,572 --> 00:47:23,774
-[contestant 6] Yohan, tag out!
-[contestant 7] Switch, switch!

1099
00:47:23,841 --> 00:47:29,814
KO YOHAN X SHIN DONGHYUN

1100
00:47:29,880 --> 00:47:31,182
He might get KO'd at this rate.

1101
00:47:31,248 --> 00:47:32,817
Show him what you've got!

1102
00:47:32,883 --> 00:47:34,418
Ready to get in that ambulance?

1103
00:47:34,485 --> 00:47:35,786
[contestant laughs]

1104
00:47:35,853 --> 00:47:37,288
[Dongeon] Last one! Keep going!

1105
00:47:37,355 --> 00:47:39,390
[contestant 8] No, he has to switch.

1106
00:47:39,457 --> 00:47:41,092
[referee, in English] Okay, stop!

1107
00:47:41,158 --> 00:47:42,426
RED CORNER SWITCH: KIM DONGEON

1108
00:47:43,427 --> 00:47:45,129
[Hyunjun, in Korean]
You're losing right now!

1109
00:47:45,196 --> 00:47:46,530
You're losing! Go all out!

1110
00:47:48,032 --> 00:47:49,133
[chattering]

1111
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:51,602
[Dongeon]
I might have to finish this with a KO.

1112
00:47:52,336 --> 00:47:53,671
[referee] All right, box!

1113
00:47:53,738 --> 00:47:55,406
[contestants chattering]

1114
00:47:56,540 --> 00:47:57,541
[contestant 1] There it is!

1115
00:47:57,608 --> 00:47:59,110
-[contestant 2] He's back in the game!
-Nice!

1116
00:47:59,176 --> 00:48:01,312
-[Hyunjun] You're losing! Go all out!
-[contestants exclaiming]

1117
00:48:01,379 --> 00:48:02,847
-There you go!
-Go get him!

1118
00:48:02,913 --> 00:48:04,782
-[Hyunjun] Go all out!
-[contestants gasping]

1119
00:48:04,849 --> 00:48:07,051
-[contestant 3] There you go!
-[contestant 4] Go get him!

1120
00:48:07,118 --> 00:48:08,452
[exclaims]

1121
00:48:10,020 --> 00:48:11,021
All right!

1122
00:48:11,088 --> 00:48:12,490
[contestant whoops]

1123
00:48:13,090 --> 00:48:15,159
[Shin Donghyun]
I'd planned for Park Youngho

1124
00:48:15,226 --> 00:48:17,661
to face Kim Dongeon from the start.

1125
00:48:20,064 --> 00:48:22,199
-[Dex] Whoa, he's here.
-[Jongkook] He's back, all right.

1126
00:48:24,769 --> 00:48:25,836
Do what you did earlier.

1127
00:48:26,470 --> 00:48:27,505
Brace yourself.

1128
00:48:28,072 --> 00:48:29,640
[contestant 1] He's being super strategic.

1129
00:48:31,142 --> 00:48:32,243
[Youngho] It doesn't hurt.

1130
00:48:32,309 --> 00:48:33,577
Just hit me all you want.

1131
00:48:35,646 --> 00:48:39,250
[Dongeon] One of us is going down today,
so let's fight.

1132
00:48:41,585 --> 00:48:42,586
[in English] Box!

1133
00:48:42,653 --> 00:48:43,954
KIM DONGEON X PARK YOUNGHO

1134
00:48:44,021 --> 00:48:45,556
[contestant 2, in Korean]
Go full throttle!

1135
00:48:46,957 --> 00:48:48,092
[Jongkook] It's any minute now.

1136
00:48:49,360 --> 00:48:50,361
[contestant 3] Okay, it's coming.

1137
00:48:50,828 --> 00:48:52,229
He's charging in!

1138
00:48:52,930 --> 00:48:54,331
He's charging in!

1139
00:48:54,932 --> 00:48:56,567
[contestant 4] Push him back with force!

1140
00:48:56,634 --> 00:48:57,935
[Jongkook] Wow, look at him go!

1141
00:48:58,469 --> 00:48:59,770
[exclaims]

1142
00:49:00,271 --> 00:49:02,006
[grunting]

1143
00:49:02,072 --> 00:49:04,408
[Jongkook] Wait,
he's not running. He should, though.

1144
00:49:04,475 --> 00:49:05,476
[Lee] Circle out of there.

1145
00:49:06,010 --> 00:49:07,011
[Jongkook] That's it.

1146
00:49:08,212 --> 00:49:09,780
[contestant 5]
Dongeon, land one clean shot,

1147
00:49:09,847 --> 00:49:11,182
-then clinch or fall back.
-[exclaims]

1148
00:49:12,750 --> 00:49:14,084
[contestant 6] Both hands on the stomach!

1149
00:49:14,585 --> 00:49:16,387
His stomach is open!

1150
00:49:16,454 --> 00:49:18,355
[contestants clamoring]

1151
00:49:18,823 --> 00:49:20,825
-[contestant 7] All right!
-[contestant 8] That's it!

1152
00:49:20,891 --> 00:49:21,892
Yes, the stomach!

1153
00:49:21,959 --> 00:49:24,528
That's it! There you go!

1154
00:49:26,430 --> 00:49:28,332
-[Dex] All right!
-[Jongkook] That's it!

1155
00:49:28,399 --> 00:49:31,035
[Lee] That's how you hit.
He's finally slowing down now.

1156
00:49:31,101 --> 00:49:32,470
[Jongkook] That's right.

1157
00:49:32,937 --> 00:49:34,972
-That did some damage.
-[clamoring]

1158
00:49:35,039 --> 00:49:36,140
It's okay!

1159
00:49:36,974 --> 00:49:38,375
Hold this out, and we win!

1160
00:49:38,442 --> 00:49:39,510
Hold this out, and we win!

1161
00:49:39,577 --> 00:49:40,578
[referee] Okay, careful now.

1162
00:49:40,644 --> 00:49:43,681
[Youngho] All I really had was grit.

1163
00:49:44,381 --> 00:49:47,117
It was my last shot,
so I went in ready to blow the tank.

1164
00:49:48,018 --> 00:49:51,388
KIM DONGEON X PARK YOUNGHO

1165
00:49:51,455 --> 00:49:53,491
-[Jongkook] Park Youngho is insane!
-[clamoring continues]

1166
00:49:53,557 --> 00:49:55,459
[Jongkook] Damn, his stamina is unreal!

1167
00:49:55,526 --> 00:49:56,861
[contestant 1] All right!

1168
00:49:58,028 --> 00:50:00,097
-[bell rings]
-[contestants cheering, applauding]

1169
00:50:01,198 --> 00:50:03,167
[contestant 2]
Man, this is freaking entertaining.

1170
00:50:03,234 --> 00:50:04,768
[applauding continues]

1171
00:50:06,737 --> 00:50:09,406
-[contestant 3] Dongeon is something else.
-[contestant 4 exclaims]

1172
00:50:10,808 --> 00:50:12,910
[all exclaim]

1173
00:50:13,611 --> 00:50:14,845
They fought really well.

1174
00:50:14,912 --> 00:50:16,280
Man, that was so good.

1175
00:50:16,347 --> 00:50:17,882
-Wow.
-[Dex] Wow.

1176
00:50:17,948 --> 00:50:20,284
-What a legendary match! [chuckles]
-[contestant applauding]

1177
00:50:20,818 --> 00:50:23,053
-I never got hit. I blocked them all.
-Huh?

1178
00:50:23,120 --> 00:50:25,623
-You did, did you?
-[judges laugh]

1179
00:50:25,689 --> 00:50:27,525
[Jongkook] He says his face is spotless.

1180
00:50:29,159 --> 00:50:32,062
[narrator]
We will now announce the result.

1181
00:50:32,129 --> 00:50:33,330
[Jongkook exclaims]

1182
00:50:33,397 --> 00:50:36,000
-It is what it is. Yes, yes.
-Right.

1183
00:50:36,066 --> 00:50:37,501
The winners of this match are…

1184
00:50:39,203 --> 00:50:42,006
Park Youngho and Shin Donghyun
from the blue corner!

1185
00:50:42,072 --> 00:50:43,774
BLUE CORNER
PARK YOUNGHO & SHIN DONGHYUN SURVIVE

1186
00:50:43,841 --> 00:50:46,143
[Jongkook] Both teams did amazing, really.

1187
00:50:47,611 --> 00:50:49,146
All right, Park Youngho.

1188
00:50:49,813 --> 00:50:51,582
You're a powerhouse, aren't you?

1189
00:50:51,649 --> 00:50:54,318
Mr. Muscles
is more than just muscles. [chuckles]

1190
00:50:54,385 --> 00:50:56,153
-His engine is insane.
-[judges laugh]

1191
00:50:56,887 --> 00:50:59,690
I mainly lift weights by profession.

1192
00:51:00,224 --> 00:51:04,061
I may seem a bit sloppy
compared to the experts here,

1193
00:51:04,128 --> 00:51:06,330
but boxing is ultimately a fistfight.

1194
00:51:06,397 --> 00:51:08,299
I just used my fists and brawled.

1195
00:51:08,966 --> 00:51:12,369
-Hope you enjoyed the fight.
-[judges, contestants cheer, applaud]

1196
00:51:12,436 --> 00:51:14,471
[contestant 1]
I think it's kind of cool, though.

1197
00:51:14,538 --> 00:51:16,807
Seeing a nonathlete push this hard.

1198
00:51:17,575 --> 00:51:21,245
[Dex] Let's move on
to our dark horse and ace of the day.

1199
00:51:21,312 --> 00:51:23,514
-You're the best. No doubt.
-[Dex] Kim Dongeon!

1200
00:51:24,348 --> 00:51:26,850
It's an honor
just to have made an impression

1201
00:51:27,351 --> 00:51:31,422
on such amazing, famous fighters here.

1202
00:51:32,022 --> 00:51:34,558
I'm from Masan, South Gyeongsang Province.

1203
00:51:34,625 --> 00:51:35,793
It's a five-hour trip.

1204
00:51:35,859 --> 00:51:41,398
So I'd like to thank my mom
for driving me back and forth every time.

1205
00:51:41,465 --> 00:51:43,233
Thank you all so much.

1206
00:51:43,300 --> 00:51:44,468
[Jongkook exclaims]

1207
00:51:44,535 --> 00:51:46,403
You did awesome, Dongeon!

1208
00:51:47,438 --> 00:51:48,806
I'm a fan!

1209
00:51:48,872 --> 00:51:49,940
Well done!

1210
00:51:50,007 --> 00:51:52,076
-[applauding]
-[Dex] Ah.

1211
00:51:52,676 --> 00:51:54,345
TAG RING SURVIVORS
CHAEHYUN & HYUNJAE

1212
00:51:54,411 --> 00:51:56,080
MINWOO & GIJUN
YOUNGHO & DONGHYUN

1213
00:51:56,146 --> 00:51:57,448
[Sungwoon] We get to see this?

1214
00:51:57,514 --> 00:51:58,849
Feels like the finals already.

1215
00:51:59,316 --> 00:52:01,352
-Box!
-They might break down the cage.

1216
00:52:01,418 --> 00:52:03,020
[contestants exclaiming]

1217
00:52:05,789 --> 00:52:08,192
[contestant 1]
Every single movement is pure artistry.

1218
00:52:08,258 --> 00:52:09,893
-[cheering]
-[grunting, groaning]

1219
00:52:10,394 --> 00:52:13,764
-[shouts]
-Wow.

1220
00:52:13,831 --> 00:52:17,568
