-[contestant 2] Is it really him?

1222
00:52:19,269 --> 00:52:20,270
[exclaims]

1223
00:52:20,337 --> 00:52:22,206
[in English] My name is Dmitry Bivol.

1224
00:52:26,176 --> 00:52:27,511
[contestant, in Korean] This is it.

1225
00:52:27,578 --> 00:52:29,513
