1226
00:52:29,580 --> 00:52:30,881
This one's gonna be fun.

1227
00:52:31,715 --> 00:52:33,050
It's the highlight of the day.

1228
00:52:33,584 --> 00:52:34,752
The main dish.

1229
00:52:34,818 --> 00:52:37,087
-It really is the main dish.
-For real.

1230
00:52:37,154 --> 00:52:39,790
[narrator]
This is I Am Boxer's aqua ring match.

1231
00:52:40,924 --> 00:52:41,992
Blue corner,

1232
00:52:42,693 --> 00:52:44,595
-Hong Sungmin.
-[contestants murmur]

1233
00:52:44,662 --> 00:52:46,764
-Oh, wow…
-[chuckles]

1234
00:52:46,830 --> 00:52:48,966
-[contestant 1] Tyson Hong…
-[contestant 2] Tyson, yes…

1235
00:52:49,033 --> 00:52:50,668
[contestant 3] Wonder how he'll play this.

1236
00:52:53,904 --> 00:52:55,172
[contestant 4 laughs]

1237
00:52:55,839 --> 00:52:57,207
[contestant 5] Nice performance.

1238
00:52:57,274 --> 00:52:58,909
[contestant 6] He's pretty explosive.

1239
00:53:00,678 --> 00:53:01,812
Man, he's built.

1240
00:53:02,780 --> 00:53:04,682
[contestant 7]
Sungmin is seriously strong.

1241
00:53:06,083 --> 00:53:09,653
[Dex] I didn't expect three challengers
to step up to Kim Minuk. [chuckles]

1242
00:53:10,220 --> 00:53:11,689
I'm going to go with

1243
00:53:12,723 --> 00:53:13,724
Hong Sungmin.

1244
00:53:13,791 --> 00:53:15,259
-Hong Sungmin.
-[exclaims]

1245
00:53:15,325 --> 00:53:16,593
[exclaims]

1246
00:53:16,660 --> 00:53:17,828
This is wild.

1247
00:53:17,895 --> 00:53:19,963
-[Jongkook] For real?
-[Dex] Seriously, this is his pick?

1248
00:53:20,531 --> 00:53:21,632
Really?

1249
00:53:22,499 --> 00:53:23,834
[narrator] Red corner,

1250
00:53:23,901 --> 00:53:25,235
Kim Minuk.

1251
00:53:25,302 --> 00:53:26,704
-All right.
-All right.

1252
00:53:26,770 --> 00:53:28,005
Whoa, awesome.

1253
00:53:28,072 --> 00:53:29,206
All right!

1254
00:53:29,273 --> 00:53:31,041
[huffs]

1255
00:53:33,243 --> 00:53:36,080
Why does he look cool
doing basically anything? [chuckles]

1256
00:53:36,680 --> 00:53:37,881
-He's got that swag.
-[chuckles]

1257
00:53:37,948 --> 00:53:39,249
He's so cool.

1258
00:53:39,850 --> 00:53:41,685
He's gonna look dope here. [laughs]

1259
00:53:42,152 --> 00:53:43,353
Let's go!

1260
00:53:43,420 --> 00:53:44,488
This is it.

1261
00:53:45,622 --> 00:53:47,524
[contestant 1]
He's a bit on the older side, isn't he?

1262
00:53:47,591 --> 00:53:49,026
[contestant 2] He's 38, I think?

1263
00:53:49,093 --> 00:53:50,794
[contestant 1] That's a 14-year age gap.

1264
00:53:52,029 --> 00:53:55,099
[Dex] Before we start,
let's hear a few words from both fighters.

1265
00:53:55,165 --> 00:53:56,366
KIM MINUK VS HONG SUNGMIN

1266
00:53:56,433 --> 00:53:58,736
I've always wanted to learn

1267
00:53:59,336 --> 00:54:00,738
from this seasoned pro here.

1268
00:54:00,804 --> 00:54:01,805
But in the ring,

1269
00:54:02,706 --> 00:54:03,707
everyone's equal.

1270
00:54:04,241 --> 00:54:06,710
As much as I respect him,
I'll give it everything I have.

1271
00:54:06,777 --> 00:54:08,045
[judges exclaim]

1272
00:54:08,545 --> 00:54:10,814
I'll show you what I'm like
when I'm in my element.

1273
00:54:10,881 --> 00:54:12,249
-That's a good line.
-[all exclaim]

1274
00:54:12,316 --> 00:54:13,751
Nicely said.

1275
00:54:14,885 --> 00:54:18,822
Hong Sungmin was on my list
of top contenders.

1276
00:54:19,490 --> 00:54:22,359
I wanted to face a strong opponent.

1277
00:54:22,426 --> 00:54:23,827
-I'm glad he challenged me.
-[all exclaim]

1278
00:54:24,328 --> 00:54:26,163
Thank you for making this happen.

1279
00:54:26,663 --> 00:54:28,098
-That's cool.
-Well said.

1280
00:54:28,165 --> 00:54:30,033
Everything about him is cool.

1281
00:54:30,100 --> 00:54:31,268
Total Bro-Snyper.

1282
00:54:32,636 --> 00:54:35,038
-They're amazing.
-Kim Minuk's still got fire, huh?

1283
00:54:35,105 --> 00:54:37,007
-[Jongkook] He is burning hot.
-Indeed.

1284
00:54:37,574 --> 00:54:40,477
-This won't be easy for Sungmin, though.
-Right.

1285
00:54:43,914 --> 00:54:46,416
-[Lee] The amateur Mike Tyson versus…
-[contestant exclaiming]

1286
00:54:46,483 --> 00:54:48,585
…the textbook example of a pro.

1287
00:54:48,652 --> 00:54:50,821
[breathing heavily]

1288
00:54:51,421 --> 00:54:53,690
[contestant 1]
Both guys are insanely skilled.

1289
00:54:53,757 --> 00:54:56,794
I'm curious what kind of fight we'll see
with their feet in the water.

1290
00:54:57,561 --> 00:55:01,064
With the way Sungmin fights,
he might not work as well in the water.

1291
00:55:01,865 --> 00:55:05,669
[Lee]
I have no idea how this one will play out.

1292
00:55:05,736 --> 00:55:07,905
[Hyunman] This is like something
straight out of a movie.

1293
00:55:08,972 --> 00:55:10,774
[Donghoe] This is gonna be a fun one.

1294
00:55:10,841 --> 00:55:12,376
I was feeling secretly excited.

1295
00:55:13,443 --> 00:55:14,678
-[in English] Box!
-[bell rings]

1296
00:55:14,745 --> 00:55:16,413
-[in Korean] Let's go!
-You got this!

1297
00:55:16,480 --> 00:55:18,382
[contestant 1] Go, Kim Minuk!

1298
00:55:18,448 --> 00:55:19,583
[contestants] Let's go!

1299
00:55:19,650 --> 00:55:24,588
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1300
00:55:24,655 --> 00:55:26,890
-[contestant 2 exclaims]
-[contestant 3] That guard is superb.

1301
00:55:26,957 --> 00:55:28,358
[grunting, groaning]

1302
00:55:28,425 --> 00:55:30,394
-Nothing's getting through.
-[contestants exclaiming]

1303
00:55:30,460 --> 00:55:32,362
[Lee] His guard's airtight,
shots keep bouncing off.

1304
00:55:33,130 --> 00:55:34,498
[contestant 4] All right, rock solid!

1305
00:55:42,940 --> 00:55:44,107
[contestant 5] His guard's adamantine.

1306
00:55:44,608 --> 00:55:45,676
Nothing's breaking that.

1307
00:55:46,977 --> 00:55:49,379
-His guard's tough to crack.
-Yeah, it's unbreakable.

1308
00:55:49,446 --> 00:55:51,181
It's like he's hitting a wall.

1309
00:55:53,150 --> 00:55:54,852
[Sungmin] His defense was solid,

1310
00:55:55,385 --> 00:55:57,087
so instead of staying still,

1311
00:55:57,154 --> 00:56:01,358
I kept tapping at his guard,
just poking nonstop,

1312
00:56:02,860 --> 00:56:04,361
thinking it'll have to open up.

1313
00:56:09,199 --> 00:56:10,367
[Lee] That tactical exchange…

1314
00:56:11,902 --> 00:56:12,903
[Dex exclaims]

1315
00:56:12,970 --> 00:56:14,438
-[contestant 1] There it is!
-[contestants exclaiming]

1316
00:56:14,504 --> 00:56:15,505
Nice going!

1317
00:56:15,572 --> 00:56:16,607
[♪ tense music playing]

1318
00:56:18,041 --> 00:56:19,543
[contestant 2] He broke his guard.

1319
00:56:19,610 --> 00:56:21,311
Look at that combo.

1320
00:56:21,778 --> 00:56:23,180
Still, he managed to counter.

1321
00:56:26,283 --> 00:56:27,784
Nice counter.

1322
00:56:27,851 --> 00:56:29,019
-[contestant 2] All right!
-Wow.

1323
00:56:31,321 --> 00:56:33,523
[Minuk] I was thinking,
"Let's meet fire with fire."

1324
00:56:33,590 --> 00:56:34,591
"Come on in."

1325
00:56:35,659 --> 00:56:38,095
[contestant 1]
Looks like he's analyzing him, right?

1326
00:56:38,161 --> 00:56:39,363
[contestant 2] You're right.

1327
00:56:40,464 --> 00:56:41,465
[Minuk, in English] Okay.

1328
00:56:41,531 --> 00:56:43,734
[in Korean] Once I had him on my line,
I could read him clearly.

1329
00:56:45,302 --> 00:56:47,004
[contestant 1, contestant 2 gasp]

1330
00:56:47,070 --> 00:56:49,072
[♪ electronic music playing]

1331
00:56:50,173 --> 00:56:51,909
[contestant 3] His double jabs are sharp.

1332
00:56:55,345 --> 00:56:56,813
[contestant 4] They're crisp and clean.

1333
00:56:58,181 --> 00:57:00,050
Man, he's driving that right in.

1334
00:57:00,651 --> 00:57:02,552
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1335
00:57:02,619 --> 00:57:05,622
[contestants gasping]

1336
00:57:05,689 --> 00:57:07,457
[contestant 2]
This is what we've been waiting for.

1337
00:57:10,327 --> 00:57:12,195
This is so intense, man. It's awesome.

1338
00:57:16,066 --> 00:57:17,701
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1339
00:57:27,077 --> 00:57:28,645
-[contestant 1 cheers]
-[contestant 2 exclaims]

1340
00:57:30,080 --> 00:57:31,448
[contestant 3, in English] Nice timing!

1341
00:57:32,249 --> 00:57:34,351
[contestant 4, in Korean]
He's fighting with ruler-like precision.

1342
00:57:38,121 --> 00:57:40,223
I'm watching with my jaw dropped.

1343
00:57:40,991 --> 00:57:42,926
Everyone's mesmerized watching this.

1344
00:57:45,629 --> 00:57:46,863
[contestants exclaiming]

1345
00:57:50,334 --> 00:57:52,936
[contestant 1]
Every single movement is pure artistry.

1346
00:57:54,471 --> 00:57:55,572
[contestants exclaiming]

1347
00:57:55,639 --> 00:57:56,773
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1348
00:57:58,508 --> 00:57:59,910
[contestant 2] He's still got it.

1349
00:57:59,977 --> 00:58:01,345
[contestants exclaiming]

1350
00:58:10,454 --> 00:58:11,455
[contestants exclaiming]

1351
00:58:11,521 --> 00:58:12,756
[contestant 3] Look at that grit!

1352
00:58:14,958 --> 00:58:15,959
Whoa, those double jabs…

1353
00:58:16,460 --> 00:58:19,463
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1354
00:58:19,529 --> 00:58:20,964
-[bell rings]
-[referee, in English] Stop!

1355
00:58:21,031 --> 00:58:22,199
[contestants exclaiming]

1356
00:58:22,265 --> 00:58:24,368
[contestant 1] So this is real boxing.

1357
00:58:24,901 --> 00:58:25,902
[exclaims]

1358
00:58:28,071 --> 00:58:29,172
[contestant 2] I'm speechless.

1359
00:58:30,173 --> 00:58:31,608
Wow, seriously.

1360
00:58:32,209 --> 00:58:35,712
You can't judge true masters instantly.
You need to observe for a while.

1361
00:58:36,313 --> 00:58:38,448
[Minuk] It's a hard setup

1362
00:58:38,515 --> 00:58:40,350
