1363
00:58:40,417 --> 00:58:42,119
Plus, there's the water.

1364
00:58:42,185 --> 00:58:46,356
So for the second round,
I decided to target Hong Sungmin's body.

1365
00:58:46,857 --> 00:58:49,292
Body shots sap your stamina

1366
00:58:49,359 --> 00:58:51,595
more than head shots do,

1367
00:58:52,329 --> 00:58:53,864
so I figured I'd target the body.

1368
00:58:58,001 --> 00:58:59,536
-[bell rings]
-[in English] Box!

1369
00:58:59,603 --> 00:59:05,642
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1370
00:59:11,715 --> 00:59:12,716
[contestant 1 exclaims]

1371
00:59:15,018 --> 00:59:16,253
[Jongkook, in Korean]
That body hook, though.

1372
00:59:16,319 --> 00:59:17,587
[♪ tense music playing]

1373
00:59:19,089 --> 00:59:20,290
[contestant 2] Okay, the torso.

1374
00:59:23,427 --> 00:59:24,428
[contestant 3] Nice torso shot.

1375
00:59:27,064 --> 00:59:29,433
-[contestant 4 exclaims]
-[Lee] That body shot landed clean!

1376
00:59:30,567 --> 00:59:32,936
[Minuk] Given his weight class,

1377
00:59:33,003 --> 00:59:35,705
the body shots affected him
exactly the way I expected.

1378
00:59:38,308 --> 00:59:39,843
[Sungmin]
Those body shots started landing.

1379
00:59:40,577 --> 00:59:41,578
And yeah, they hurt.

1380
00:59:45,382 --> 00:59:46,383
[Minuk] All right.

1381
00:59:53,256 --> 00:59:54,825
[contestants exclaiming]

1382
00:59:54,891 --> 00:59:56,093
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1383
00:59:58,595 --> 00:59:59,830
[contestants gasping]

1384
01:00:02,933 --> 01:00:04,301
The sensor lit up!

1385
01:00:07,938 --> 01:00:09,239
[contestant] Sungmin, lower your stance!

1386
01:00:12,776 --> 01:00:15,679
[Sungmin] I knew I'd lose
the moment I let him get under my skin.

1387
01:00:19,616 --> 01:00:21,051
[contestants exclaiming]

1388
01:00:27,023 --> 01:00:28,024
[Jongkook] This is insane.

1389
01:00:28,625 --> 01:00:29,960
What am I watching right now?

1390
01:00:34,998 --> 01:00:39,836
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1391
01:00:39,903 --> 01:00:41,304
-[contestant 1] All right!
-[contestant 2 exclaims]

1392
01:00:41,371 --> 01:00:42,672
[contestant 3 laughs] This is rad.

1393
01:00:43,173 --> 01:00:45,742
[contestant 4]
Those two are literally shooting a movie.

1394
01:00:46,843 --> 01:00:48,812
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1395
01:00:48,879 --> 01:00:50,213
[contestant 5, contestant 6 exclaim]

1396
01:01:00,090 --> 01:01:01,091
Sungmin's caught.

1397
01:01:02,759 --> 01:01:03,927
[contestant 1] He ate that shot.

1398
01:01:04,794 --> 01:01:07,030
[contestant 2]
Minuk is seriously good, though.

1399
01:01:07,697 --> 01:01:10,500
[Minuk]
I'd held back in rounds one and two

1400
01:01:10,567 --> 01:01:12,569
and kept parts of my game hidden.

1401
01:01:13,336 --> 01:01:15,539
[Seungjun] The size difference
isn't affecting him one bit.

1402
01:01:18,175 --> 01:01:19,776
-[Dex] Are we getting extra time?
-[exclaims]

1403
01:01:20,577 --> 01:01:21,945
-Oh, Sungmin is…
-[exclaims]

1404
01:01:22,012 --> 01:01:25,282
Sungmin's starting to gas out.

1405
01:01:25,348 --> 01:01:29,986
[Sungmin] Honestly, this would've been
tough even in a dry, regular ring.

1406
01:01:32,022 --> 01:01:33,857
[contestant 1] It's all about stamina now.

1407
01:01:34,925 --> 01:01:36,059
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1408
01:01:36,660 --> 01:01:38,195
[contestant 2] Ten seconds! Let's go!

1409
01:01:42,065 --> 01:01:43,633
-[contestants gasping]
-[bell rings]

1410
01:01:45,302 --> 01:01:46,603
-[bell ringing]
-[in English] Stop!

1411
01:01:47,404 --> 01:01:48,705
[gasping]

1412
01:01:49,539 --> 01:01:51,074
-[Dex, in Korean] Goodness.
-[gasps]

1413
01:01:51,641 --> 01:01:53,076
[contestant 1] Gosh, that was insane.

1414
01:01:54,244 --> 01:01:55,345
That was freaking cool.

1415
01:01:56,413 --> 01:01:58,215
[Jongkook] This is the true definition

1416
01:01:58,281 --> 01:02:00,150
-of a hold-your-breath moment.
-[Dex] That's right.

1417
01:02:01,184 --> 01:02:02,752
[contestant]
Why isn't Sungmin sitting down?

1418
01:02:03,720 --> 01:02:04,955
Is it pride holding him up?

1419
01:02:05,722 --> 01:02:07,157
He does seem exhausted.

1420
01:02:07,224 --> 01:02:09,726
This tactic is meant
to mess with your opponent.

1421
01:02:09,793 --> 01:02:12,329
Apparently,
some fighters stay standing on purpose.

1422
01:02:12,395 --> 01:02:13,730
To crush your will.

1423
01:02:13,797 --> 01:02:15,031
[contestants applauding]

1424
01:02:15,098 --> 01:02:17,200
[Sungmin]
It was much more exhausting than expected.

1425
01:02:17,267 --> 01:02:21,605
Kim Minuk is a well-seasoned fighter.

1426
01:02:21,671 --> 01:02:24,708
I knew I'd lose
the moment I let him get under my skin.

1427
01:02:25,242 --> 01:02:27,811
So I tried hard not to get pulled into it

1428
01:02:27,877 --> 01:02:29,312
and kept thinking to myself…

1429
01:02:31,548 --> 01:02:32,782
"This is the last round."

1430
01:02:32,849 --> 01:02:33,917
"And I have to win."

1431
01:02:35,518 --> 01:02:36,519
[bell rings]

1432
01:02:36,586 --> 01:02:38,221
Okay, last round. Touch gloves.

1433
01:02:38,288 --> 01:02:40,457
[Dex] This is it! It's the last round!

1434
01:02:40,523 --> 01:02:41,591
-[contestant 1] Last round!
-[contestant 2] All right!

1435
01:02:41,658 --> 01:02:42,659
[in English] Box!

1436
01:02:42,726 --> 01:02:43,927
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1437
01:02:48,031 --> 01:02:49,432
[contestant 3, in Korean] All right!

1438
01:02:49,499 --> 01:02:51,034
[contestant 4]
Where's that uppercut, though?

1439
01:02:51,568 --> 01:02:52,569
[contestant 5 exclaims]

1440
01:02:53,103 --> 01:02:54,537
[♪ tense music playing]

1441
01:02:58,975 --> 01:03:00,076
[contestants exclaiming]

1442
01:03:01,311 --> 01:03:03,346
[contestant 6]
He claimed the center just like that.

1443
01:03:03,413 --> 01:03:05,048
He's cornered him, now he'll strike.

1444
01:03:05,115 --> 01:03:06,383
[Jongkook] Yeah, he's going in.

1445
01:03:06,950 --> 01:03:08,518
He's really trying to end this, huh?

1446
01:03:09,185 --> 01:03:11,655
[Sungmin] I was a bit rattled
at the start of the third round.

1447
01:03:11,721 --> 01:03:13,456
I thought, "This is bad."

1448
01:03:13,523 --> 01:03:15,325
[contestant 1]
How do you break that guard?

1449
01:03:15,392 --> 01:03:16,393
[contestant 2] It's not easy.

1450
01:03:25,168 --> 01:03:27,470
[Lee] Hong Sungmin is waiting to counter.

1451
01:03:30,240 --> 01:03:31,675
[contestants exclaiming]

1452
01:03:31,741 --> 01:03:33,410
[gasps, exclaims]

1453
01:03:33,476 --> 01:03:34,911
He read everything and fired back!

1454
01:03:35,578 --> 01:03:37,514
[Lee] Whenever Minuk
throws that right hand,

1455
01:03:37,580 --> 01:03:39,215
he counters with his right hook.

1456
01:03:39,716 --> 01:03:41,918
[Sungmin]
When Kim Minuk threw a right hook,

1457
01:03:41,985 --> 01:03:43,553
I saw his right jaw open up,

1458
01:03:43,620 --> 01:03:45,121
so I threw one there immediately.

1459
01:03:45,188 --> 01:03:50,060
Then I felt Kim Minuk's guard
start to spread out a bit.

1460
01:03:50,126 --> 01:03:52,696
So I thought,
"Time to put on a spurt and push on."

1461
01:03:52,762 --> 01:03:54,764
[contestants exclaiming]

1462
01:03:55,899 --> 01:03:56,900
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1463
01:04:03,139 --> 01:04:05,108
[exclaims, gasps]

1464
01:04:05,175 --> 01:04:07,143
Their speed's insane.

1465
01:04:07,210 --> 01:04:08,545
Like bam, bam, bam.

1466
01:04:08,611 --> 01:04:10,080
-[contestant 1] Let's go!
-[contestant 2 exclaims]

1467
01:04:10,146 --> 01:04:11,481
[contestant 3] This is pure art.

1468
01:04:11,548 --> 01:04:13,149
[contestant 4] We're halfway there!

1469
01:04:13,216 --> 01:04:14,217
[Dex] Last round!

1470
01:04:14,284 --> 01:04:15,819
[contestant 5]
This final stretch is brutal.

1471
01:04:20,623 --> 01:04:22,959
-[contestant 1] Last one!
-[contestant 2] All right!

1472
01:04:23,026 --> 01:04:24,327
[contestant 6] You're almost there, Minuk!

1473
01:04:24,394 --> 01:04:25,395
[Dex] Let's go!

1474
01:04:25,462 --> 01:04:26,896
Stopping will only slow you down!

1475
01:04:26,963 --> 01:04:28,565
-[contestant 7] All right, focus!
-[contestant 8 laughs]

1476
01:04:28,631 --> 01:04:29,632
[contestants exclaiming]

1477
01:04:29,699 --> 01:04:30,734
[contestant 7] …focus!

1478
01:04:31,468 --> 01:04:32,969
[contestants exclaiming]

1479
01:04:35,171 --> 01:04:37,073
[contestant 1]
Hong Sungmin is doing incredibly well.

1480
01:04:37,140 --> 01:04:38,141
[contestant 2] Let's go, Kim Minuk!

1481
01:04:39,175 --> 01:04:41,044
[contestants cheering]

1482
01:04:42,379 --> 01:04:44,547
-[contestant 2, contestant 3 exclaims]
-[contestant 4] Kim Minuk, you got this!

1483
01:04:44,614 --> 01:04:45,882
Keep going!

1484
01:04:48,485 --> 01:04:49,886
His stamina might be the issue.

1485
01:04:49,953 --> 01:04:51,788
-[contestant 5] Come on!
-[contestant 6] Thirty seconds!

1486
01:04:52,288 --> 01:04:54,657
[Minuk] With just a few seconds remaining,

1487
01:04:54,724 --> 01:04:56,526
I wanted to pour out whatever I had left.

1488
01:04:58,161 --> 01:05:00,196
I thought,
"Let me do this. It's do or die now."

1489
01:05:00,263 --> 01:05:01,598
[♪ heroic music playing]

1490
01:05:02,665 --> 01:05:04,100
[contestants exclaiming]

1491
01:05:06,636 --> 01:05:08,171
Just go all in now!

1492
01:05:08,238 --> 01:05:09,639
[contestant 3] Keep going till the end!

1493
01:05:09,706 --> 01:05:11,141
[contestants exclaiming]

1494
01:05:11,207 --> 01:05:12,942
[contestant 1] Keep your head in the game!

1495
01:05:13,009 --> 01:05:14,344
[contestant 2, contestant 3] All right!

1496
01:05:15,445 --> 01:05:18,481
KIM MINUK X HONG SUNGMIN

1497
01:05:21,284 --> 01:05:23,253
[Minuk] I admit I was kind of in a daze.

1498
01:05:23,319 --> 01:05:26,890
I felt that dopamine explosion you feel
when you've poured everything out.

1499
01:05:32,429 --> 01:05:33,963
-[contestants cheer]
-[bell rings]

1500
01:05:40,970 --> 01:05:43,006
-That was absolutely insane.
-[Jongkook laughs]

1501
01:05:45,608 --> 01:05:46,943
[Jongkook, Dex gasp]

1502
01:05:50,180 --> 01:05:51,981
[laughing]

1503
01:05:52,048 --> 01:05:53,450
[contestant 1] Man, that was amazing.

1504
01:05:53,516 --> 01:05:55,018
[contestant 2 gasps]

1505
01:05:55,084 --> 01:05:56,786
-I fought a legend like that?
-[laughs]

1506
01:05:57,787 --> 01:06:00,290
[Jongkook]
I'm at a complete loss for words.

1507
01:06:01,391 --> 01:06:02,725
Wow, I mean…

1508
01:06:02,792 --> 01:06:05,061
I mean, Kim Minuk… He's…

1509
01:06:05,595 --> 01:06:08,031
He gives me a headache every single time.

1510
01:06:08,531 --> 01:06:09,966
Fantastic fight.

1511
01:06:10,033 --> 01:06:11,701
That was a fantastic fight.

1512
01:06:11,768 --> 01:06:13,603
Let me announce the result.

1513
01:06:13,670 --> 01:06:14,671
[♪ tense music playing]

1514
01:06:14,737 --> 01:06:15,839
The winner is…

1515
01:06:16,873 --> 01:06:19,542
[Minuk] I thought I deserved the win.

1516
01:06:20,109 --> 01:06:21,778
[Sungmin] I was sure I had it.

1517
01:06:23,146 --> 01:06:25,515
Hong Sungmin from the blue corner!

1518
01:06:25,582 --> 01:06:26,683
[contestants cheering]

1519
01:06:26,749 --> 01:06:29,219
Hong Sungmin from the blue corner!

1520
01:06:29,285 --> 01:06:32,489
BLUE CORNER
HONG SUNGMIN SURVIVES

1521
01:06:37,794 --> 01:06:39,662
I feel so small, man.

1522
01:06:40,830 --> 01:06:42,932
Going last came with its own pressure.

1523
01:06:43,633 --> 01:06:45,735
I'll take the weight
that comes with beating someone

1524
01:06:45,802 --> 01:06:49,172
I respect as much as Minuk
and participate in I Am Boxer

1525
01:06:50,039 --> 01:06:51,474
with even more hunger.

1526
01:06:54,811 --> 01:06:59,382
It's been a while since I sparred
like it was an actual fight.

1527
01:06:59,449 --> 01:07:01,017
I'm actually really relieved now.

1528
01:07:01,518 --> 01:07:05,488
I'm glad I still got to show what I have.

1529
01:07:05,555 --> 01:07:06,623
Moving forward,

1530
01:07:07,257 --> 01:07:10,026
if boxing ever needs me,
just give me a call.

1531
01:07:10,093 --> 01:07:12,495
I'll be there. Thank you.

1532
01:07:16,499 --> 01:07:20,336
AQUA RING SURVIVORS
SEUNGJUN, JUNSEO, TAEKMIN, SUNGMIN

1533
01:07:21,404 --> 01:07:22,405
[contestant] It's the final match.

1534
01:07:23,206 --> 01:07:24,607
Here we go.

1535
01:07:25,808 --> 01:07:27,143
What a big match.

1536
01:07:28,912 --> 01:07:29,913
Are we seeing this now?

1537
01:07:29,979 --> 01:07:31,314
-That's right.
-Goodness.

1538
01:07:31,881 --> 01:07:33,683
-Oh, boy.
-[Jongkook] What do we do now?

1539
01:07:35,184 --> 01:07:36,185
I'd totally forgotten.

1540
01:07:36,686 --> 01:07:38,755
-Well, I'm tapping out.
-[Dex laughs] Same here.

1541
01:07:38,821 --> 01:07:40,390
Darn it.

1542
01:07:40,456 --> 01:07:43,426
[announcer]
This is I Am Boxer's cage ring match.

1543
01:07:44,193 --> 01:07:45,962
Fighters, step in.

1544
01:07:46,629 --> 01:07:49,566
Red corner, Kim Donghoe.

1545
01:07:49,632 --> 01:07:51,200
Let's go!

1546
01:07:51,267 --> 01:07:52,669
[contestant 1] You got this, man!

1547
01:07:54,103 --> 01:07:55,672
[contestant 2]
Man, I can't wait to see this.

1548
01:07:55,738 --> 01:07:56,973
[♪ tense music playing]

1549
01:08:02,145 --> 01:08:04,581
[Jongkook]
If you wish to challenge Kim Donghoe,

1550
01:08:04,647 --> 01:08:06,916
please step forward.

1551
01:08:07,884 --> 01:08:09,452
[Lee] Will anyone step forward?

1552
01:08:11,588 --> 01:08:12,655
[Jongkook, Lee exclaim]

1553
01:08:12,722 --> 01:08:15,525
I had an inkling.
He's actually stepping forward.

1554
01:08:16,459 --> 01:08:19,128
[contestants gasping, cheering]

1555
01:08:20,730 --> 01:08:21,864
[contestant 1] You're a legend!

1556
01:08:23,399 --> 01:08:24,567
[contestant 3] It's the Grim Reaper.

1557
01:08:25,501 --> 01:08:28,638
Here's another
pay-to-view material right here.

1558
01:08:29,472 --> 01:08:31,908
-We get to see this?
-Feels like the finals already.

1559
01:08:33,109 --> 01:08:34,978
[Donghoe]
When Myung Hyunman challenged me,

1560
01:08:35,044 --> 01:08:37,447
I thought, "Wow, this is perfect."

1561
01:08:38,014 --> 01:08:40,149
I'd always wanted to go up against him.

1562
01:08:40,216 --> 01:08:42,218
I think we could make a hell of a fight.

1563
01:08:43,786 --> 01:08:46,489
[Hyunman]
There's only one guy I'm wary of,

1564
01:08:46,556 --> 01:08:47,657
Kim Donghoe.

1565
01:08:48,157 --> 01:08:50,326
Our matchup came sooner than I expected.

1566
01:08:50,393 --> 01:08:51,661
Fine, let's get this over with.

1567
01:08:52,295 --> 01:08:54,130
[announcer] Blue corner, Myung Hyunman.

1568
01:08:54,197 --> 01:08:55,531
All right!

1569
01:08:55,598 --> 01:08:57,066
Let's go!

1570
01:08:57,734 --> 01:08:59,469
[contestant 1]
He's got real knockout power.

1571
01:08:59,535 --> 01:09:02,071
[contestant 2]
This is terrifying. I'm scared already.

1572
01:09:04,173 --> 01:09:05,842
[contestant 4]
They make the cage look small.

1573
01:09:06,409 --> 01:09:08,878
[contestant 5] They're massive.
Looks like we're in for a ride. [laughs]

1574
01:09:08,945 --> 01:09:10,546
[contestant 6]
There's a bit of a weight difference.

1575
01:09:10,613 --> 01:09:12,015
[contestant 7] Maybe 20 kilos?

1576
01:09:12,515 --> 01:09:14,917
[gasps] I can't believe we're seeing this.

1577
01:09:15,485 --> 01:09:16,653
The best versus the best.

1578
01:09:17,654 --> 01:09:22,125
It's an honor to have the chance
to face someone like Kim Donghoe.

1579
01:09:22,191 --> 01:09:24,927
I'll do my best to show what I can do.

1580
01:09:27,430 --> 01:09:30,566
I'll give it my all
and make this a great fight.

1581
01:09:30,633 --> 01:09:32,301
-[Jongkook exclaims]
-[contestants applaud]

1582
01:09:32,802 --> 01:09:34,937
Man, this one's impossible to predict.

1583
01:09:35,004 --> 01:09:37,940
[announcer] Please prepare for the fight.

1584
01:09:38,007 --> 01:09:39,308
[♪ tense music playing]

1585
01:09:39,876 --> 01:09:42,178
[Jongkook]
Donghoe doesn't really fight close-range.

1586
01:09:42,245 --> 01:09:43,246
Right.

1587
01:09:43,312 --> 01:09:46,215
-I'm not sure how he'll do in there.
-Yeah.

1588
01:09:46,783 --> 01:09:47,984
You need to dominate early.

1589
01:09:48,051 --> 01:09:49,452
Myung Hyunman's a beast.

1590
01:09:50,620 --> 01:09:53,356
[contestant 1]
And he's insanely strong too.

1591
01:09:54,424 --> 01:09:55,992
He just drops all the heavyweights.

1592
01:09:57,593 --> 01:09:58,995
[contestant 2] If that lands, it's over.

1593
01:10:00,897 --> 01:10:03,666
-[Lee] Hyunman has the one-shot power.
-[Jongkook exclaims]

1594
01:10:04,233 --> 01:10:07,503
In terms of pure boxing skill,
Kim Donghoe is on a higher level.

1595
01:10:08,004 --> 01:10:09,005
But who knows?

1596
01:10:09,572 --> 01:10:11,441
No one can know how this will go.

1597
01:10:12,942 --> 01:10:15,578
[Donghoe] The weight difference
didn't really matter to me.

1598
01:10:16,279 --> 01:10:19,515
I was confident I could win.

1599
01:10:20,917 --> 01:10:22,618
[Hyunman] I'm not easy work.

1600
01:10:22,685 --> 01:10:25,722
I'm nothing like any opponent
he's faced before.

1601
01:10:25,788 --> 01:10:26,856
Buckle up for this.

1602
01:10:28,224 --> 01:10:29,492
[contestant 1] This is gonna be epic.

1603
01:10:29,559 --> 01:10:30,693
[contestant 2] It's gonna be fun.

1604
01:10:31,461 --> 01:10:33,730
[announcer]
Kim Donghoe versus Myung Hyunman.

1605
01:10:33,796 --> 01:10:35,131
[Jongkook] Gosh, this is…

1606
01:10:35,198 --> 01:10:38,101
[announcer] Let us begin the fight.

1607
01:10:38,668 --> 01:10:40,636
Everyone, let's hear it for them.

1608
01:10:40,703 --> 01:10:42,205
[in English] Box!

1609
01:10:43,072 --> 01:10:44,073
Box!

1610
01:10:44,640 --> 01:10:45,641
[contestant 1, in Korean] Let's go!

1611
01:10:45,708 --> 01:10:46,809
KIM DONGHOE X MYUNG HYUNMAN

1612
01:10:46,876 --> 01:10:47,977
[contestant 2] Don't get worked up. Go.

1613
01:10:48,044 --> 01:10:50,079
[contestant 3] His feints are scary.

1614
01:10:50,146 --> 01:10:51,948
[contestant 4]
Yeah, since he blitzes in right after.

1615
01:10:52,815 --> 01:10:54,083
[contestants gasping]

1616
01:10:57,220 --> 01:10:58,855
[contestants gasping]

1617
01:11:01,090 --> 01:11:02,125
[contestant 5] That's scary.

1618
01:11:03,359 --> 01:11:05,728
[Donghoe] When he hit my guard,
I thought, "Man, he's strong."

1619
01:11:05,795 --> 01:11:07,063
"He's strong."

1620
01:11:07,130 --> 01:11:08,131
That's what I felt.

1621
01:11:08,197 --> 01:11:10,767
I thought, "One clean shot can finish me."

1622
01:11:10,833 --> 01:11:12,935
"Let's keep the guard tight
and slip the shots."

1623
01:11:13,002 --> 01:11:14,370
[contestant 1] Nice! That landed!

1624
01:11:16,038 --> 01:11:17,240
[contestant 2] Guard up!

1625
01:11:17,974 --> 01:11:18,975
[contestant 1] One shot could drop him.

1626
01:11:19,776 --> 01:11:21,277
[contestant 2]
They might break down the cage.

1627
01:11:21,778 --> 01:11:22,945
[contestant 3] Nice cover!

1628
01:11:26,249 --> 01:11:28,651
[contestant 4] It's crazy how clean
he throws when he's that loose.

1629
01:11:29,318 --> 01:11:31,220
-[contestant 6] Relax!
-[contestant 7] The Ghost is here.

1630
01:11:34,190 --> 01:11:36,359
Feels like a polar bear
and a brown bear fighting.

1631
01:11:37,260 --> 01:11:38,261
[contestant 1] Get in there.

1632
01:11:41,130 --> 01:11:42,732
[contestants exclaiming]

1633
01:11:44,834 --> 01:11:47,303
[contestant 3] Whoa, that power…
He's basically flailing.

1634
01:11:50,740 --> 01:11:51,974
[contestant 5] Move! Guard up!

1635
01:11:55,945 --> 01:11:57,780
[Lee] He's trying to push him rough.

1636
01:11:57,847 --> 01:11:59,515
[Jongkook] I think you're right.

1637
01:11:59,582 --> 01:12:01,017
He's going dirty boxing on him.

1638
01:12:02,318 --> 01:12:04,086
So that's his game plan.

1639
01:12:04,687 --> 01:12:07,256
[Hyunman]
Kim Donghoe's punches are really fast.

1640
01:12:07,323 --> 01:12:08,858
In this cage setup,

1641
01:12:09,458 --> 01:12:13,429
I figured I needed
to neutralize Kim Donghoe's main weapon.

1642
01:12:13,496 --> 01:12:15,064
It's called "dirty boxing."

1643
01:12:15,131 --> 01:12:16,699
You hit while staying in close.

1644
01:12:17,600 --> 01:12:18,901
You grab the hands,

1645
01:12:18,968 --> 01:12:20,503
and clinch pressure to shut him down.

1646
01:12:20,570 --> 01:12:21,971
That's the technique I used.

1647
01:12:23,072 --> 01:12:24,073
[in English] Break!

1648
01:12:24,574 --> 01:12:25,641
Break.

1649
01:12:25,708 --> 01:12:28,945
KIM DONGHOE X MYUNG HYUNMAN

1650
01:12:29,011 --> 01:12:30,980
-[Lee, in Korean] He's clinching again.
-[Jongkook] Right.

1651
01:12:31,547 --> 01:12:33,115
[contestant]
Is that the strategy he came in with?

1652
01:12:33,883 --> 01:12:37,286
If it comes down to straight punching,
Donghoe would clearly have the advantage.

1653
01:12:38,187 --> 01:12:40,456
It could really go either way now.

1654
01:12:41,057 --> 01:12:42,959
[contestant] Myung Hyunman came in
with a smart game plan.

1655
01:12:45,661 --> 01:12:48,331
[Jongkook] He's ditching punches
and going full clinch.

1656
01:12:48,397 --> 01:12:49,398
He's smothering him.

1657
01:12:49,465 --> 01:12:51,033
That's what this feels like.

1658
01:12:51,968 --> 01:12:53,836
That looks miserable to be stuck in.

1659
01:12:54,737 --> 01:12:58,507
[Donghoe] I kept thinking,
"I need to get out of this clinch,"

1660
01:12:58,574 --> 01:13:00,610
but he was just too strong.

1661
01:13:00,676 --> 01:13:02,144
I couldn't shake him off.

1662
01:13:02,845 --> 01:13:04,847
Man, that looks suffocating.

1663
01:13:04,914 --> 01:13:06,616
He's completely shut him down.

1664
01:13:09,185 --> 01:13:10,853
[Jongkook]
He's giving him a real hard time.

1665
01:13:11,554 --> 01:13:12,955
[contestant 1] Looks painfully stifling.

1666
01:13:16,359 --> 01:13:17,827
[contestants exclaiming]

1667
01:13:19,095 --> 01:13:20,096
[contestant 4] He spun him back.

1668
01:13:20,162 --> 01:13:22,265
[contestant 5]
This is Myung Hyunman's best bet.

1669
01:13:22,331 --> 01:13:23,366
This is the way to win.

1670
01:13:23,432 --> 01:13:24,800
-[referee, in English] Break!
-[bell rings]

1671
01:13:24,867 --> 01:13:26,168
-Stop!
-[contestant 6, in Korean] All right!

1672
01:13:27,303 --> 01:13:28,905
Man, I don't know.

1673
01:13:28,971 --> 01:13:30,706
This could go either way.

1674
01:13:30,773 --> 01:13:32,909
This is the most viable strategy, though.

1675
01:13:32,975 --> 01:13:35,778
The problem is,
Hyunman hasn't really landed anything.

1676
01:13:36,379 --> 01:13:38,281
He barely threw actual strikes.

1677
01:13:38,347 --> 01:13:41,550
If they trade in that clinch
and fight it out, it could go either way.

1678
01:13:42,718 --> 01:13:44,687
[Donghoe]
I didn't do much in the first round.

1679
01:13:44,754 --> 01:13:46,822
I knew I couldn't go on like this.

1680
01:13:46,889 --> 01:13:49,358
So in the next round,
I knew I had to attack

1681
01:13:49,425 --> 01:13:52,662
whenever I got him off me
and score some points.

1682
01:13:53,529 --> 01:13:55,564
[Hyunman]
I instantly knew he was no pushover.

1683
01:13:55,631 --> 01:13:58,467
I needed to find more openings
and do more damage.

1684
01:13:59,902 --> 01:14:01,771
[announcer] Fighters, step in.

1685
01:14:06,309 --> 01:14:07,310
[bell rings]

1686
01:14:07,376 --> 01:14:08,778
-[contestant] Let's go!
-[referee, in English] Box!

1687
01:14:08,844 --> 01:14:09,912
KIM DONGHOE X MYUNG HYUNMAN

1688
01:14:10,780 --> 01:14:12,315
[contestant 1, in Korean] There you go!

1689
01:14:12,381 --> 01:14:13,516
[contestant 3] He's firing right away.

1690
01:14:15,751 --> 01:14:17,820
-[contestant 5] All right!
-[contestant 6] Damn, that's weighty.

1691
01:14:17,887 --> 01:14:19,221
[♪ rock music playing]

1692
01:14:21,057 --> 01:14:22,525
[contestants exclaiming]

1693
01:14:24,026 --> 01:14:26,128
Even a single shot's seriously dangerous.

1694
01:14:28,297 --> 01:14:30,499
Nice, he's blocking
and dodging everything.

1695
01:14:40,576 --> 01:14:42,979
[Donghoe] I thought,
"I've got to show something this round."

1696
01:14:43,546 --> 01:14:45,614
"I'll attack hard when he's off me."

1697
01:14:45,681 --> 01:14:46,682
[in English] Break!

1698
01:14:50,186 --> 01:14:51,821
[contestant, in Korean]
Don't get clipped there.

1699
01:14:52,455 --> 01:14:53,656
[contestants exclaiming]

1700
01:14:57,126 --> 01:14:58,594
[contestant 1]
He shouldn't give him any openings.

1701
01:15:02,665 --> 01:15:04,166
[contestant 4 laughs]
His boxing is incredible.

1702
01:15:04,233 --> 01:15:06,068
He landed shots through every little gap.

1703
01:15:06,135 --> 01:15:07,169
[in English] Break!

1704
01:15:10,906 --> 01:15:12,308
[contestant 1] All right!

1705
01:15:16,545 --> 01:15:18,414
[contestant 1] Man, see his combos there?

1706
01:15:19,915 --> 01:15:21,384
He's found his rhythm.

1707
01:15:22,618 --> 01:15:23,652
[contestant 3] He's trying to ice him.

1708
01:15:23,719 --> 01:15:25,121
[contestant 4] Catch him!

1709
01:15:25,187 --> 01:15:26,455
[Donghoe] I couldn't lose just yet.

1710
01:15:27,089 --> 01:15:28,290
So I went all in.

1711
01:15:29,558 --> 01:15:30,559
[Jongkook] Thirty seconds!

1712
01:15:31,227 --> 01:15:33,295
Thirty seconds left! Thirty seconds!

1713
01:15:33,362 --> 01:15:35,965
KIM DONGHOE X MYUNG HYUNMAN

1714
01:15:36,032 --> 01:15:38,534
He needs to show up for this last one.

1715
01:15:39,368 --> 01:15:41,337
-[in English] Break!
-[contestant 1, in Korean] Nice!

1716
01:15:41,404 --> 01:15:43,406
-[contestant 2] Doing well!
-[contestant 3] Catch him!

1717
01:15:45,775 --> 01:15:48,010
[Hyunman] Kim Donghoe kept slipping

1718
01:15:48,077 --> 01:15:49,612
and landing shots on me.

1719
01:15:50,279 --> 01:15:52,048
I needed that one decisive blow.

1720
01:15:52,815 --> 01:15:55,718
So I decided to pour
all the energy I had left into this.

1721
01:15:55,785 --> 01:15:57,219
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1722
01:15:57,286 --> 01:15:58,788
-[Dex] Ten seconds!
-[contestants cheer]

1723
01:15:59,455 --> 01:16:00,523
[contestant 1] Let's go one last time!

1724
01:16:00,589 --> 01:16:02,291
[contestant 2] There's his kill shot.
Whoa, that landed!

1725
01:16:03,392 --> 01:16:04,393
[contestant 3] Last one!

1726
01:16:05,561 --> 01:16:08,864
KIM DONGHOE X MYUNG HYUNMAN

1727
01:16:14,170 --> 01:16:15,171
-[in English] Break!
-[bell rings]

1728
01:16:17,239 --> 01:16:18,240
-Break!
-[bell rings]

1729
01:16:19,241 --> 01:16:20,376
[Jongkook laughs, gasps]

1730
01:16:23,412 --> 01:16:24,947
He should've started off like that.

1731
01:16:25,448 --> 01:16:27,450
He was waiting for that last minute.

1732
01:16:28,017 --> 01:16:29,385
[contestant 1]
They're on a different level.

1733
01:16:29,452 --> 01:16:31,587
[contestant 2] His boxing is superb.

1734
01:16:31,654 --> 01:16:34,023
He unloaded everything at the very end.

1735
01:16:35,091 --> 01:16:37,460
[announcer]
We will now announce the result.

1736
01:16:38,828 --> 01:16:40,296
The winner of this match is…

1737
01:16:41,630 --> 01:16:45,234
[Hyunman]
I wanted to take the win so badly,

1738
01:16:45,301 --> 01:16:46,769
so I felt extremely nervous.

1739
01:16:47,303 --> 01:16:48,504
[Donghoe] My heart was racing.

1740
01:16:48,571 --> 01:16:50,306
I was worried my hand wouldn't get raised.

1741
01:16:53,042 --> 01:16:54,577
[Lee] Kim Donghoe from the red corner.

1742
01:16:55,177 --> 01:16:57,012
[contestants applaud]

1743
01:16:57,580 --> 01:16:58,581
RED CORNER KIM DONGHOE SURVIVES

1744
01:16:58,647 --> 01:17:00,216
-[Jongkook] Nice.
-That was nerve-wracking.

1745
01:17:00,282 --> 01:17:01,283
[Dex exclaims]

1746
01:17:01,350 --> 01:17:04,053
[Donghoe] I was so happy that I won.

1747
01:17:04,587 --> 01:17:08,357
[Dex] Myung Hyunman,
you've been eliminated from I Am Boxer.

1748
01:17:08,424 --> 01:17:09,758
Any last words?

1749
01:17:09,825 --> 01:17:12,294
Yeah, I'm disappointed,
but that's the fight I gave today.

1750
01:17:12,361 --> 01:17:14,196
While fighting someone like Kim Donghoe,

1751
01:17:14,263 --> 01:17:16,298
I learned a lot in a short time.

1752
01:17:16,365 --> 01:17:19,635
I'll work on the areas
where I fell short and grow from this.

1753
01:17:21,437 --> 01:17:23,806
You did well. Well fought!

1754
01:17:23,873 --> 01:17:26,809
[Hyunman] I feel honored
to have been part of this fight.

1755
01:17:26,876 --> 01:17:30,646
Even though I lost,
this is a fight that will stay with me,

1756
01:17:30,713 --> 01:17:34,216
honestly, for the rest of my career.

1757
01:17:34,750 --> 01:17:35,751
[♪ soft music playing]

1758
01:17:35,818 --> 01:17:37,086
[announcer] The cage ring.

1759
01:17:37,153 --> 01:17:38,420
The tag ring.

1760
01:17:38,487 --> 01:17:39,788
The aqua ring.

1761
01:17:39,855 --> 01:17:42,191
All matches have now concluded.

1762
01:17:42,258 --> 01:17:45,995
The blockbuster boxing survival show,
I Am Boxer.

1763
01:17:46,061 --> 01:17:48,898
Round 3 is now officially over.

1764
01:17:48,964 --> 01:17:51,834
To all 15 fighters
who survived the three rings,

1765
01:17:51,901 --> 01:17:54,436
I offer my heartfelt congratulations.

1766
01:17:54,503 --> 01:17:56,238
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

1767
01:17:56,305 --> 01:17:57,740
Well done, everyone.

1768
01:17:57,806 --> 01:17:59,775
Well fought.

1769
01:17:59,842 --> 01:18:01,310
I made it this far.

1770
01:18:01,944 --> 01:18:03,145
Fifteen, huh?

1771
01:18:03,212 --> 01:18:04,480
Sounds like an achievement.

1772
01:18:05,281 --> 01:18:06,482
[Dex] Well fought.

1773
01:18:06,549 --> 01:18:07,950
[Jongkook] Thank you.

1774
01:18:08,017 --> 01:18:09,485
-Well fought.
-You did well, guys.

1775
01:18:09,552 --> 01:18:10,819
-Well done.
-Thank you.

1776
01:18:10,886 --> 01:18:12,054
Hey, well done.

1777
01:18:12,121 --> 01:18:13,389
-You were awesome.
-Thank you.

1778
01:18:13,455 --> 01:18:16,292
Seriously, you did so well.

1779
01:18:16,859 --> 01:18:18,928
It's a shame to send you off like this.

1780
01:18:18,994 --> 01:18:20,029
No, I had fun.

1781
01:18:20,095 --> 01:18:21,230
-Thanks, Hyunman.
-Thank you.

1782
01:18:21,297 --> 01:18:22,898
Thanks. Well done.

1783
01:18:22,965 --> 01:18:24,400
[♪ stirring music playing]

1784
01:18:24,466 --> 01:18:26,001
[Hyunman] I'm definitely disappointed.

1785
01:18:26,068 --> 01:18:28,304
It's upsetting, of course.

1786
01:18:28,370 --> 01:18:30,172
But after retiring from the ring,

1787
01:18:30,239 --> 01:18:32,441
I've solely been living as a family man.

1788
01:18:33,509 --> 01:18:35,044
So coming onto I Am Boxer

1789
01:18:35,110 --> 01:18:38,147
and trading punches with real boxers again

1790
01:18:38,214 --> 01:18:41,350
made me feel like the boxer

1791
01:18:41,417 --> 01:18:43,385
I used to watch on TV.

1792
01:18:43,452 --> 01:18:45,487
It was a truly rewarding experience.

1793
01:18:45,554 --> 01:18:50,626
Boxing has been with me for 26 years,

1794
01:18:50,693 --> 01:18:52,695
so almost half my life.

1795
01:18:52,761 --> 01:18:55,831
It has been amazing and fun

1796
01:18:55,898 --> 01:18:58,601
to have been able
to put myself out there again.

1797
01:18:58,667 --> 01:19:00,369
It was genuinely fulfilling.

1798
01:19:03,772 --> 01:19:06,008
-[Lee] This should be enough, right?
-[Dex] Yeah.

1799
01:19:07,509 --> 01:19:09,545
But why are there so many gloves here?

1800
01:19:09,612 --> 01:19:12,047
These are gifts for the students

1801
01:19:12,114 --> 01:19:14,583
at Seoul Physical Education High School.

1802
01:19:14,650 --> 01:19:16,785
-You prepared these for them?
-That's right.

1803
01:19:16,852 --> 01:19:17,853
[gasps]

1804
01:19:17,920 --> 01:19:21,190
Remember the punching bags
we used in our matches?

1805
01:19:21,257 --> 01:19:22,925
[Dex] Oh, the ones we used in Round 2?

1806
01:19:22,992 --> 01:19:25,861
[Lee] I'm thinking we could sign them
and send them off too.

1807
01:19:25,928 --> 01:19:27,263
[Dex exclaims]

1808
01:19:27,329 --> 01:19:28,597
Okay, I got these.

1809
01:19:28,664 --> 01:19:29,898
-No, no.
-But you hurt your ribs.

1810
01:19:29,965 --> 01:19:32,568
-Yeah, but I can still lift.
-No, I'll take this.

1811
01:19:32,635 --> 01:19:33,869
I can carry it, really.

1812
01:19:33,936 --> 01:19:35,471
-No, I'll do it.
-I got this.

1813
01:19:35,537 --> 01:19:37,406
-Why'd you hurt your ribs?
-I can still do it.

1814
01:19:37,473 --> 01:19:38,674
-I got this.
-Oh, boy.

1815
01:19:39,875 --> 01:19:41,543
Where should we load this? In this car?

1816
01:19:41,610 --> 01:19:42,811
-That's right.
-Is it yours?

1817
01:19:42,878 --> 01:19:44,413
No, sir.

1818
01:19:44,480 --> 01:19:46,582
This is for the winner.

1819
01:19:46,649 --> 01:19:48,684
[Lee]
A prize of 300 million won and this car?

1820
01:19:48,751 --> 01:19:50,419
Honestly, I'm a bit jealous.

1821
01:19:50,486 --> 01:19:52,588
-I should've competed instead.
-[Dex laughs]

1822
01:19:52,655 --> 01:19:54,923
[Dex] A large SUV like this

1823
01:19:54,990 --> 01:19:56,558
is the true symbol of success.

1824
01:19:57,059 --> 01:19:59,061
It even has a touchpad.

1825
01:19:59,595 --> 01:20:01,730
Hit this button and the seat reclines.

1826
01:20:01,797 --> 01:20:03,699
[Lee] Oh, it's actually moving.

1827
01:20:05,267 --> 01:20:06,835
-Want me to recline it?
-No, I'm good.

1828
01:20:06,902 --> 01:20:08,570
-Really?
-Yeah, my ribs hurt.

1829
01:20:09,305 --> 01:20:11,473
If I lean back,
the pain shoots up tenfold.

1830
01:20:11,540 --> 01:20:14,276
It hurts when I laugh too.

1831
01:20:14,343 --> 01:20:16,345
-So try not to make me laugh.
-Got it.

1832
01:20:17,579 --> 01:20:19,448
Here we are
at Seoul Physical Education High School.

1833
01:20:19,515 --> 01:20:21,383
[Dex]
Feels like a school with real tradition.

1834
01:20:23,786 --> 01:20:25,788
-One, two, three!
-One, two, three!

1835
01:20:25,854 --> 01:20:27,289
One, two, three!

1836
01:20:33,629 --> 01:20:35,764
-Hi there.
-Hello, everyone.

1837
01:20:35,831 --> 01:20:38,167
-Hello, sir.
-Hello, everyone.

1838
01:20:40,269 --> 01:20:42,805
-[Dex] Was today's school lunch good?
-No, it wasn't.

1839
01:20:42,871 --> 01:20:44,406
Well, these will be good.

1840
01:20:44,473 --> 01:20:46,008
[students cheer]

1841
01:20:46,642 --> 01:20:48,143
[Dex] Take off your gloves and come.

1842
01:20:48,210 --> 01:20:49,445
-[student 2] Okay.
-[student 3] Got it.

1843
01:20:49,511 --> 01:20:51,547
Since we're here,

1844
01:20:51,613 --> 01:20:53,816
we should feed the kids something.

1845
01:20:53,882 --> 01:20:54,983
Let's get them some food.

1846
01:20:55,050 --> 01:20:56,251
I'm going to order delivery.

1847
01:20:56,318 --> 01:20:57,820
There are around 10 kids,

1848
01:20:57,886 --> 01:20:59,254
so 20 portions?

1849
01:20:59,321 --> 01:21:02,858
-Okay.
-But first, you pick something out.

1850
01:21:02,925 --> 01:21:06,395
-What are you getting?
-I've got a new favorite these days.

1851
01:21:07,162 --> 01:21:10,699
The BBQ Rotisserie-Style Chicken,
and this one, marked as a popular item,

1852
01:21:10,766 --> 01:21:12,835
the "Anchang Beef."
It's real tasty, you know.

1853
01:21:12,901 --> 01:21:15,104
All right, I love protein.

1854
01:21:15,170 --> 01:21:18,006
-Protein's crucial for aspiring athletes.
-Yes, of course.

1855
01:21:18,607 --> 01:21:20,342
-[student 1] Thank you for the food.
-[student 2] Appreciate it.

1856
01:21:21,243 --> 01:21:22,578
[Dex] Please enjoy.

1857
01:21:22,644 --> 01:21:23,879
How does it taste?

1858
01:21:23,946 --> 01:21:25,013
-Tasty.
-Delicious.

1859
01:21:25,080 --> 01:21:26,515
Well, that's a relief.

1860
01:21:26,582 --> 01:21:27,950
Help yourself.

1861
01:21:28,917 --> 01:21:31,120
There's a lot of chicken breast in here.

1862
01:21:31,186 --> 01:21:32,321
And it tastes good.

1863
01:21:33,922 --> 01:21:35,958
-[student 2] Gotta have that wow factor.
-[Lee] Exactly.

1864
01:21:36,458 --> 01:21:37,526
[Dex] You're all good-looking.

1865
01:21:37,593 --> 01:21:39,795
[Lee]
Boxers these days are really good-looking.

1866
01:21:40,362 --> 01:21:42,464
Say they've been boxing for a long time,

1867
01:21:42,531 --> 01:21:43,966
and they look like Dex.

1868
01:21:44,500 --> 01:21:46,201
That probably means they're really good.

1869
01:21:47,236 --> 01:21:48,337
Say they look like me.

1870
01:21:49,438 --> 01:21:51,407
That means
they probably take a lot of shots.

1871
01:21:51,473 --> 01:21:53,375
That means
they probably take a lot of shots.

1872
01:21:55,477 --> 01:21:57,646
He kind of looks like Mike Tyson.

1873
01:21:57,713 --> 01:21:59,715
-Let me get a closer look.
-[Dex] He looks like Tyson.

1874
01:22:00,215 --> 01:22:02,151
-But he looks manly.
-Nice face.

1875
01:22:02,217 --> 01:22:03,318
You have my kind of face.

1876
01:22:03,385 --> 01:22:04,486
[student] I take a lot of hits.

1877
01:22:04,553 --> 01:22:06,722
[Dex] Do you, really? [laughs]

1878
01:22:07,523 --> 01:22:09,391
I don't know how much help this'll be,

1879
01:22:09,458 --> 01:22:11,960
but we've brought some gloves
and punching bags over.

1880
01:22:12,027 --> 01:22:15,030
-Use them, train hard, and keep it up.
-Keep up the good work.

1881
01:22:16,832 --> 01:22:19,201
Your footwork's gonna improve in no time.

1882
01:22:19,268 --> 01:22:23,939
Hey, Yonghyeok's girlfriend, Shin ***.

1883
01:22:24,907 --> 01:22:26,208
-What's your name?
-Yonghyeok.

1884
01:22:26,275 --> 01:22:28,444
Yonghyeok, you got this!

1885
01:22:28,944 --> 01:22:29,945
-I got this!
-Great.

1886
01:22:30,012 --> 01:22:31,880
[students] Thank you.

1887
01:22:31,947 --> 01:22:33,081
[students applauding]

1888
01:22:33,148 --> 01:22:35,884
[Jongkook]
Today, Master Don here has invited

1889
01:22:35,951 --> 01:22:37,319
a very special guest!

1890
01:22:38,520 --> 01:22:40,355
[in English] My name is Dmitry Bivol.

1891
01:22:40,422 --> 01:22:42,124
[Jongkook, in Korean]
Please welcome Dmitry Bivol!

1892
01:22:42,191 --> 01:22:44,092
-[contestant 1] Whoa, that's really him!
-[contestants cheering]

1893
01:22:44,960 --> 01:22:46,695
[Dex]
They're smelling his belt and everything.

1894
01:22:46,762 --> 01:22:48,330
[contestant 2] How is this even real?

1895
01:22:48,397 --> 01:22:50,265
I can't believe I'm seeing this right now.

1896
01:22:51,333 --> 01:22:53,202
[Lee] You're about to witness
a fight more extreme

1897
01:22:53,268 --> 01:22:54,870
than anything you've ever seen.

1898
01:22:54,937 --> 01:22:56,104
[in English] Box!

1899
01:22:56,171 --> 01:22:58,140
-[contestant 1] They're both insane.
-[contestant 2] This is intense.

1900
01:22:58,707 --> 01:22:59,708
He wants the KO finish.

1901
01:22:59,775 --> 01:23:01,577
[contestant 2]
Ten seconds left! Hang in there!

1902
01:23:01,643 --> 01:23:02,878
[in English] Heavyweights.

1903
01:23:02,945 --> 01:23:07,049
[Dex, in Korean]
I was hoping to see this matchup.

1904
01:23:09,551 --> 01:23:10,619
[contestant 1] I was bleeding.

1905
01:23:10,686 --> 01:23:12,488
[contestant 2] I knew I could still fight.

1906
01:23:12,554 --> 01:23:13,689
[in English] He's a crazy guy.

1907
01:23:13,755 --> 01:23:15,491
[contestant 1]
It didn't matter if I was bleeding.

1908
01:23:15,557 --> 01:23:17,326
The survivor of this match is…

1909
01:23:17,392 --> 01:23:18,427
no one.

1910
01:23:18,494 --> 01:23:19,928
-[contestant 1 groans]
-[contestant 2] Everyone's eliminated?

1911
01:23:19,995 --> 01:23:23,131
[contestant 1] It was a place
beyond anything we could've imagined.

1912
01:23:23,198 --> 01:23:24,633
[contestant 2] So it's not over yet.

1913
01:23:24,700 --> 01:23:26,268
[♪ tense music playing]

1914
01:23:26,335 --> 01:23:28,837
[contestant 3] We fought to the death,
and now we're doing it again?

1915
01:23:29,505 --> 01:23:31,039
[contestant 4]
Finally, the moment has come.

1916
01:23:33,208 --> 01:23:35,143
[♪ upbeat music playing]

1917
01:23:53,262 --> 01:23:55,264
Translated by Jisu Park

